;(function(H){for(var l in H){window.PS_I18N[l]=Object.assign(window.PS_I18N[l]||{},H[l]);}})({"es": {"Live results over a Keynote slide while you present": "Resultados en directo sobre una diapositiva de Keynote mientras presentas", "PowerPoint add-in available today": "Complemento de PowerPoint disponible hoy", "Pricing at a glance": "Precios de un vistazo", "Plan": "Plan", "$0 — 25 participants per session, 3 saved presentations": "0 $: 25 participantes por sesión, 3 presentaciones guardadas", "$0 — limited participants each month": "0 $: participantes limitados cada mes", "Individual": "Individual", "Pro — $12/month, or $10/month billed annually": "Pro: 12 $/mes, o 10 $/mes con facturación anual", "Basic $11.99 · Pro $24.99 per presenter/month, billed yearly": "Basic 11,99 $ · Pro 24,99 $ por presentador/mes, facturación anual", "Teams": "Equipos", "Team Small $39/month (up to 5) · Team Large $199/month (up to 25)": "Team Small 39 $/mes (hasta 5) · Team Large 199 $/mes (hasta 25)", "Pro or Enterprise, per presenter": "Pro o Enterprise, por presentador", "Large organisations": "Grandes organizaciones", "Enterprise — custom": "Enterprise: a medida", "Prices in US dollars, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Precios en dólares estadounidenses, comprobados el 7 de octubre de 2026 en la página de precios de cada empresa. Cambian: confírmalos en", "our pricing page": "nuestra página de precios", "and Mentimeter's before you decide.": "y en la de Mentimeter antes de decidir.", "If you'd rather build your entire presentation inside one interactive editor — and you don't already have a deck you want to keep — Mentimeter is a mature, well-designed choice with a big template library. It also has a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app available today; ours is in review with Microsoft. PollSlide shines when you want to keep your own slides — Keynote included — and add interactivity + AI on top.": "Si prefieres crear toda la presentación dentro de un solo editor interactivo, y no tienes ya una presentación que quieras conservar, Mentimeter es una opción madura y bien diseñada con una gran biblioteca de plantillas. Además, ya tiene un complemento de PowerPoint para la app de escritorio; el nuestro está en revisión por Microsoft. PollSlide brilla cuando quieres conservar tus propias diapositivas, Keynote incluido, y añadir interactividad + IA encima.", "Questions people ask": "Preguntas frecuentes", "Is PollSlide a good Mentimeter alternative?": "¿Es PollSlide una buena alternativa a Mentimeter?", "Yes, if you want to keep presenting from your own slides. PollSlide adds live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top of Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF, instead of asking you to rebuild your presentation in a new editor. If you would rather build everything inside one interactive tool, Mentimeter is a strong choice.": "Sí, si quieres seguir presentando con tus propias diapositivas. PollSlide añade encuestas en directo, cuestionarios, formularios y preguntas del público sobre Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF, en lugar de obligarte a rehacer tu presentación en un editor nuevo. Si prefieres crearlo todo dentro de una sola herramienta interactiva, Mentimeter es una buena opción.", "Can I keep using my PowerPoint or Keynote slides?": "¿Puedo seguir usando mis diapositivas de PowerPoint o Keynote?", "Yes. Paste your poll's QR code onto any slide and your audience answers on their phones. On a Mac, the free PollSlide companion floats live results over your slideshow — Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF — and shows the right poll when that slide is on screen.": "Sí. Pega el código QR de tu encuesta en cualquier diapositiva y tu público responde desde el móvil. En un Mac, la app complementaria gratuita de PollSlide muestra los resultados en directo sobre tu presentación (Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF) y enseña la encuesta correcta cuando esa diapositiva está en pantalla.", "Does Mentimeter work inside PowerPoint?": "¿Mentimeter funciona dentro de PowerPoint?", "Yes. Mentimeter offers a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app on all its plans; according to its help center it does not run in PowerPoint online. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is built and in review with Microsoft, and the QR-on-slide method works in PowerPoint today.": "Sí. Mentimeter ofrece un complemento de PowerPoint para la app de escritorio en todos sus planes; según su centro de ayuda, no funciona en PowerPoint en línea. El complemento de PowerPoint de PollSlide está terminado y en revisión por Microsoft, y el método del QR en la diapositiva ya funciona en PowerPoint.", "How do PollSlide and Mentimeter prices compare?": "¿Cómo se comparan los precios de PollSlide y Mentimeter?", "Both have a free plan. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually) and covers polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan. Mentimeter's paid plans are $11.99 (Basic) and $24.99 (Pro) per presenter per month, billed yearly. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "Los dos tienen plan gratuito. PollSlide Pro cuesta 12 $ al mes (10 $ con facturación anual) e incluye encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio en un solo plan. Los planes de pago de Mentimeter cuestan 11,99 $ (Basic) y 24,99 $ (Pro) por presentador al mes, con facturación anual. Precios comprobados el 7 de octubre de 2026.", "Does my audience need to download an app?": "¿Mi público tiene que descargar una app?", "No — with either tool. In PollSlide, people scan the QR or go to pollslide.com/join and answer in their phone's browser, with no app and no account.": "No, con ninguna de las dos herramientas. En PollSlide, la gente escanea el QR o va a pollslide.com/join y responde en el navegador del móvil, sin app y sin cuenta.", "See also:": "Ver también:", "PollSlide for PowerPoint": "PollSlide para PowerPoint", "PollSlide for Keynote": "PollSlide para Keynote", "pricing": "precios", "game modes": "modos de juego", "study games": "juegos de estudio", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Mentimeter and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparativa basada en información pública, comprobada el 7 de octubre de 2026. Las funciones y precios de la competencia cambian a menudo: verifícalos en su sitio. Mentimeter y otros nombres son marcas de sus respectivos titulares; esta página no está respaldada por ellos ni afiliada a ellos."}, "de": {"Live results over a Keynote slide while you present": "Live-Ergebnisse über einer Keynote-Folie während der Präsentation", "PowerPoint add-in available today": "PowerPoint-Add-in schon heute verfügbar", "Pricing at a glance": "Preise auf einen Blick", "Plan": "Tarif", "$0 — 25 participants per session, 3 saved presentations": "0 $ – 25 Teilnehmende pro Sitzung, 3 gespeicherte Decks", "$0 — limited participants each month": "0 $ – begrenzte Teilnehmerzahl pro Monat", "Individual": "Einzelperson", "Pro — $12/month, or $10/month billed annually": "Pro – 12 $/Monat oder 10 $/Monat bei jährlicher Abrechnung", "Basic $11.99 · Pro $24.99 per presenter/month, billed yearly": "Basic 11,99 $ · Pro 24,99 $ pro Vortragende:n/Monat, jährliche Abrechnung", "Teams": "Teams", "Team Small $39/month (up to 5) · Team Large $199/month (up to 25)": "Team Small 39 $/Monat (bis zu 5) · Team Large 199 $/Monat (bis zu 25)", "Pro or Enterprise, per presenter": "Pro oder Enterprise, pro Vortragende:n", "Large organisations": "Große Organisationen", "Enterprise — custom": "Enterprise – individuell", "Prices in US dollars, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Preise in US-Dollar, am 7. Oktober 2026 auf der jeweiligen Preisseite geprüft. Sie ändern sich – bitte prüf sie auf", "our pricing page": "unserer Preisseite", "and Mentimeter's before you decide.": "und der von Mentimeter, bevor du dich entscheidest.", "If you'd rather build your entire presentation inside one interactive editor — and you don't already have a deck you want to keep — Mentimeter is a mature, well-designed choice with a big template library. It also has a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app available today; ours is in review with Microsoft. PollSlide shines when you want to keep your own slides — Keynote included — and add interactivity + AI on top.": "Wenn du lieber deine ganze Präsentation in einem einzigen interaktiven Editor baust – und noch kein Deck hast, das du behalten willst –, ist Mentimeter eine ausgereifte, gut gestaltete Wahl mit großer Vorlagenbibliothek. Es hat außerdem schon heute ein PowerPoint-Add-in für die Desktop-App; unseres wird gerade von Microsoft geprüft. PollSlide glänzt, wenn du deine eigenen Folien behalten willst – Keynote inklusive – und Interaktivität + KI obendrauf setzen möchtest.", "Questions people ask": "Häufige Fragen", "Is PollSlide a good Mentimeter alternative?": "Ist PollSlide eine gute Alternative zu Mentimeter?", "Yes, if you want to keep presenting from your own slides. PollSlide adds live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top of Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF, instead of asking you to rebuild your presentation in a new editor. If you would rather build everything inside one interactive tool, Mentimeter is a strong choice.": "Ja, wenn du weiter mit deinen eigenen Folien präsentieren willst. PollSlide legt Live-Umfragen, Quizze, Befragungen und Publikumsfragen über Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides oder ein PDF, statt dich deine Präsentation in einem neuen Editor nachbauen zu lassen. Wenn du lieber alles in einem interaktiven Tool baust, ist Mentimeter eine starke Wahl.", "Can I keep using my PowerPoint or Keynote slides?": "Kann ich meine PowerPoint- oder Keynote-Folien weiter nutzen?", "Yes. Paste your poll's QR code onto any slide and your audience answers on their phones. On a Mac, the free PollSlide companion floats live results over your slideshow — Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF — and shows the right poll when that slide is on screen.": "Ja. Füge den QR-Code deiner Umfrage auf eine beliebige Folie ein, und dein Publikum antwortet auf dem Handy. Auf dem Mac blendet die kostenlose PollSlide-Begleit-App Live-Ergebnisse über deiner Präsentation ein – Keynote, PowerPoint oder ein PDF – und zeigt die passende Umfrage, sobald die Folie zu sehen ist.", "Does Mentimeter work inside PowerPoint?": "Funktioniert Mentimeter in PowerPoint?", "Yes. Mentimeter offers a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app on all its plans; according to its help center it does not run in PowerPoint online. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is built and in review with Microsoft, and the QR-on-slide method works in PowerPoint today.": "Ja. Mentimeter bietet in allen Tarifen ein PowerPoint-Add-in für die Desktop-App an; laut seinem Hilfecenter läuft es nicht in PowerPoint online. Das PowerPoint-Add-in von PollSlide ist fertig und wird von Microsoft geprüft, und der QR-Code auf der Folie funktioniert schon heute in PowerPoint.", "How do PollSlide and Mentimeter prices compare?": "Wie unterscheiden sich die Preise von PollSlide und Mentimeter?", "Both have a free plan. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually) and covers polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan. Mentimeter's paid plans are $11.99 (Basic) and $24.99 (Pro) per presenter per month, billed yearly. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "Beide haben einen kostenlosen Tarif. PollSlide Pro kostet 12 $ im Monat (10 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung) und umfasst Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze und Lernsets in einem Tarif. Die bezahlten Tarife von Mentimeter kosten 11,99 $ (Basic) und 24,99 $ (Pro) pro Vortragende:n und Monat, jährlich abgerechnet. Preise geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026.", "Does my audience need to download an app?": "Muss mein Publikum eine App herunterladen?", "No — with either tool. In PollSlide, people scan the QR or go to pollslide.com/join and answer in their phone's browser, with no app and no account.": "Nein – bei keinem der beiden Tools. Bei PollSlide scannen die Leute den QR-Code oder gehen auf pollslide.com/join und antworten im Browser ihres Handys, ohne App und ohne Konto.", "See also:": "Siehe auch:", "PollSlide for PowerPoint": "PollSlide für PowerPoint", "PollSlide for Keynote": "PollSlide für Keynote", "pricing": "Preise", "game modes": "Spielmodi", "study games": "Lernspiele", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Mentimeter and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Vergleich auf Basis öffentlich verfügbarer Informationen, geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026. Funktionen und Preise der Mitbewerber ändern sich oft – bitte auf deren Website prüfen. Mentimeter und andere Namen sind Marken ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber; diese Seite wird von ihnen weder unterstützt noch steht sie mit ihnen in Verbindung."}, "fr": {"Live results over a Keynote slide while you present": "Résultats en direct sur une diapo Keynote pendant que tu présentes", "PowerPoint add-in available today": "Complément PowerPoint disponible aujourd’hui", "Pricing at a glance": "Les prix en un coup d’œil", "Plan": "Offre", "$0 — 25 participants per session, 3 saved presentations": "0 $ — 25 participants par session, 3 présentations enregistrées", "$0 — limited participants each month": "0 $ — participants limités chaque mois", "Individual": "Individuel", "Pro — $12/month, or $10/month billed annually": "Pro — 12 $/mois, ou 10 $/mois en facturation annuelle", "Basic $11.99 · Pro $24.99 per presenter/month, billed yearly": "Basic 11,99 $ · Pro 24,99 $ par présentateur/mois, facturation annuelle", "Teams": "Équipes", "Team Small $39/month (up to 5) · Team Large $199/month (up to 25)": "Team Small 39 $/mois (jusqu’à 5) · Team Large 199 $/mois (jusqu’à 25)", "Pro or Enterprise, per presenter": "Pro ou Enterprise, par présentateur", "Large organisations": "Grandes organisations", "Enterprise — custom": "Enterprise — sur mesure", "Prices in US dollars, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Prix en dollars américains, vérifiés le 7 octobre 2026 sur la page tarifs de chaque entreprise. Ils changent — vérifie-les sur", "our pricing page": "notre page tarifs", "and Mentimeter's before you decide.": "et celle de Mentimeter avant de décider.", "If you'd rather build your entire presentation inside one interactive editor — and you don't already have a deck you want to keep — Mentimeter is a mature, well-designed choice with a big template library. It also has a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app available today; ours is in review with Microsoft. PollSlide shines when you want to keep your own slides — Keynote included — and add interactivity + AI on top.": "Si tu préfères construire toute ta présentation dans un seul éditeur interactif — et que tu n’as pas déjà une présentation à garder —, Mentimeter est un choix mûr et bien conçu, avec une grande bibliothèque de modèles. Il dispose aussi dès aujourd’hui d’un complément PowerPoint pour l’application de bureau ; le nôtre est en cours de validation par Microsoft. PollSlide brille quand tu veux garder tes propres diapos — Keynote compris — et ajouter l’interactivité + l’IA par-dessus.", "Questions people ask": "Les questions qu’on nous pose", "Is PollSlide a good Mentimeter alternative?": "PollSlide est-il une bonne alternative à Mentimeter ?", "Yes, if you want to keep presenting from your own slides. PollSlide adds live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top of Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF, instead of asking you to rebuild your presentation in a new editor. If you would rather build everything inside one interactive tool, Mentimeter is a strong choice.": "Oui, si tu veux continuer à présenter avec tes propres diapos. PollSlide ajoute des sondages en direct, des quiz, des enquêtes et des questions du public par-dessus Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou un PDF, au lieu de te faire reconstruire ta présentation dans un nouvel éditeur. Si tu préfères tout créer dans un seul outil interactif, Mentimeter est un bon choix.", "Can I keep using my PowerPoint or Keynote slides?": "Puis-je continuer à utiliser mes diapos PowerPoint ou Keynote ?", "Yes. Paste your poll's QR code onto any slide and your audience answers on their phones. On a Mac, the free PollSlide companion floats live results over your slideshow — Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF — and shows the right poll when that slide is on screen.": "Oui. Colle le QR code de ton sondage sur n’importe quelle diapo et ton public répond sur son téléphone. Sur Mac, l’appli compagnon gratuite PollSlide affiche les résultats en direct par-dessus ton diaporama — Keynote, PowerPoint ou un PDF — et montre le bon sondage dès que la diapo est à l’écran.", "Does Mentimeter work inside PowerPoint?": "Mentimeter fonctionne-t-il dans PowerPoint ?", "Yes. Mentimeter offers a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app on all its plans; according to its help center it does not run in PowerPoint online. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is built and in review with Microsoft, and the QR-on-slide method works in PowerPoint today.": "Oui. Mentimeter propose un complément PowerPoint pour l’application de bureau sur toutes ses offres ; d’après son centre d’aide, il ne fonctionne pas dans PowerPoint en ligne. Le complément PowerPoint de PollSlide est prêt et en cours de validation par Microsoft, et la méthode du QR sur la diapo fonctionne déjà dans PowerPoint.", "How do PollSlide and Mentimeter prices compare?": "Comment se comparent les prix de PollSlide et de Mentimeter ?", "Both have a free plan. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually) and covers polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan. Mentimeter's paid plans are $11.99 (Basic) and $24.99 (Pro) per presenter per month, billed yearly. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "Les deux ont une offre gratuite. PollSlide Pro coûte 12 $ par mois (10 $ en facturation annuelle) et inclut sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision dans une seule offre. Les offres payantes de Mentimeter coûtent 11,99 $ (Basic) et 24,99 $ (Pro) par présentateur et par mois, en facturation annuelle. Prix vérifiés le 7 octobre 2026.", "Does my audience need to download an app?": "Mon public doit-il télécharger une appli ?", "No — with either tool. In PollSlide, people scan the QR or go to pollslide.com/join and answer in their phone's browser, with no app and no account.": "Non — avec aucun des deux outils. Avec PollSlide, les gens scannent le QR ou vont sur pollslide.com/join et répondent dans le navigateur de leur téléphone, sans appli ni compte.", "See also:": "Voir aussi :", "PollSlide for PowerPoint": "PollSlide pour PowerPoint", "PollSlide for Keynote": "PollSlide pour Keynote", "pricing": "tarifs", "game modes": "modes de jeu", "study games": "jeux de révision", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Mentimeter and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparatif fondé sur des informations publiques, vérifiées le 7 octobre 2026. Les fonctionnalités et les prix des concurrents changent souvent — vérifie-les sur leur site. Mentimeter et les autres noms sont des marques de leurs propriétaires respectifs ; cette page n’est ni approuvée par eux ni affiliée à eux."}, "pt": {"Live results over a Keynote slide while you present": "Resultados em direto sobre um diapositivo do Keynote enquanto apresenta", "PowerPoint add-in available today": "Suplemento do PowerPoint já disponível", "Pricing at a glance": "Preços num relance", "Plan": "Plano", "$0 — 25 participants per session, 3 saved presentations": "0 $ — 25 participantes por sessão, 3 apresentações guardadas", "$0 — limited participants each month": "0 $ — participantes limitados por mês", "Individual": "Individual", "Pro — $12/month, or $10/month billed annually": "Pro — 12 $/mês, ou 10 $/mês com faturação anual", "Basic $11.99 · Pro $24.99 per presenter/month, billed yearly": "Basic 11,99 $ · Pro 24,99 $ por apresentador/mês, faturação anual", "Teams": "Equipas", "Team Small $39/month (up to 5) · Team Large $199/month (up to 25)": "Team Small 39 $/mês (até 5) · Team Large 199 $/mês (até 25)", "Pro or Enterprise, per presenter": "Pro ou Enterprise, por apresentador", "Large organisations": "Grandes organizações", "Enterprise — custom": "Enterprise — personalizado", "Prices in US dollars, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Preços em dólares norte-americanos, verificados a 7 de outubro de 2026 na página de preços de cada empresa. Mudam — confirme-os na", "our pricing page": "nossa página de preços", "and Mentimeter's before you decide.": "e na da Mentimeter antes de decidir.", "If you'd rather build your entire presentation inside one interactive editor — and you don't already have a deck you want to keep — Mentimeter is a mature, well-designed choice with a big template library. It also has a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app available today; ours is in review with Microsoft. PollSlide shines when you want to keep your own slides — Keynote included — and add interactivity + AI on top.": "Se preferir criar toda a apresentação num único editor interativo — e ainda não tiver uma apresentação que queira manter —, o Mentimeter é uma escolha madura e bem concebida, com uma grande biblioteca de modelos. Também já tem um suplemento do PowerPoint para a aplicação de secretária; o nosso está em análise pela Microsoft. O PollSlide destaca-se quando quer manter os seus próprios diapositivos — Keynote incluído — e acrescentar interatividade + IA por cima.", "Questions people ask": "Perguntas frequentes", "Is PollSlide a good Mentimeter alternative?": "O PollSlide é uma boa alternativa ao Mentimeter?", "Yes, if you want to keep presenting from your own slides. PollSlide adds live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top of Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF, instead of asking you to rebuild your presentation in a new editor. If you would rather build everything inside one interactive tool, Mentimeter is a strong choice.": "Sim, se quiser continuar a apresentar com os seus próprios diapositivos. O PollSlide acrescenta sondagens em direto, quizzes, inquéritos e perguntas do público sobre o Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou um PDF, em vez de o obrigar a refazer a apresentação num novo editor. Se preferir criar tudo numa só ferramenta interativa, o Mentimeter é uma boa escolha.", "Can I keep using my PowerPoint or Keynote slides?": "Posso continuar a usar os meus diapositivos do PowerPoint ou do Keynote?", "Yes. Paste your poll's QR code onto any slide and your audience answers on their phones. On a Mac, the free PollSlide companion floats live results over your slideshow — Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF — and shows the right poll when that slide is on screen.": "Sim. Cole o código QR da sua sondagem em qualquer diapositivo e o seu público responde no telemóvel. Num Mac, a aplicação complementar gratuita do PollSlide mostra os resultados em direto sobre a apresentação — Keynote, PowerPoint ou um PDF — e apresenta a sondagem certa quando esse diapositivo está no ecrã.", "Does Mentimeter work inside PowerPoint?": "O Mentimeter funciona dentro do PowerPoint?", "Yes. Mentimeter offers a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app on all its plans; according to its help center it does not run in PowerPoint online. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is built and in review with Microsoft, and the QR-on-slide method works in PowerPoint today.": "Sim. O Mentimeter oferece um suplemento do PowerPoint para a aplicação de secretária em todos os planos; segundo o seu centro de ajuda, não funciona no PowerPoint online. O suplemento do PowerPoint do PollSlide está concluído e em análise pela Microsoft, e o método do QR no diapositivo já funciona no PowerPoint.", "How do PollSlide and Mentimeter prices compare?": "Como se comparam os preços do PollSlide e do Mentimeter?", "Both have a free plan. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually) and covers polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan. Mentimeter's paid plans are $11.99 (Basic) and $24.99 (Pro) per presenter per month, billed yearly. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "Ambos têm um plano gratuito. O PollSlide Pro custa 12 $ por mês (10 $ com faturação anual) e inclui sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo num só plano. Os planos pagos do Mentimeter custam 11,99 $ (Basic) e 24,99 $ (Pro) por apresentador por mês, com faturação anual. Preços verificados a 7 de outubro de 2026.", "Does my audience need to download an app?": "O meu público tem de transferir uma aplicação?", "No — with either tool. In PollSlide, people scan the QR or go to pollslide.com/join and answer in their phone's browser, with no app and no account.": "Não — com nenhuma das duas ferramentas. No PollSlide, as pessoas digitalizam o QR ou acedem a pollslide.com/join e respondem no navegador do telemóvel, sem aplicação e sem conta.", "See also:": "Ver também:", "PollSlide for PowerPoint": "PollSlide para PowerPoint", "PollSlide for Keynote": "PollSlide para Keynote", "pricing": "preços", "game modes": "modos de jogo", "study games": "jogos de estudo", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Mentimeter and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparação baseada em informação pública, verificada a 7 de outubro de 2026. As funcionalidades e os preços da concorrência mudam com frequência — confirme no site deles. Mentimeter e outros nomes são marcas dos respetivos titulares; esta página não é aprovada por eles nem está afiliada a eles."}, "it": {"Live results over a Keynote slide while you present": "Risultati dal vivo sopra una slide di Keynote mentre presenti", "PowerPoint add-in available today": "Componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint già disponibile", "Pricing at a glance": "I prezzi in breve", "Plan": "Piano", "$0 — 25 participants per session, 3 saved presentations": "0 $: 25 partecipanti per sessione, 3 presentazioni salvate", "$0 — limited participants each month": "0 $: partecipanti limitati ogni mese", "Individual": "Individuale", "Pro — $12/month, or $10/month billed annually": "Pro: 12 $/mese, o 10 $/mese con fatturazione annuale", "Basic $11.99 · Pro $24.99 per presenter/month, billed yearly": "Basic 11,99 $ · Pro 24,99 $ per relatore/mese, fatturazione annuale", "Teams": "Team", "Team Small $39/month (up to 5) · Team Large $199/month (up to 25)": "Team Small 39 $/mese (fino a 5) · Team Large 199 $/mese (fino a 25)", "Pro or Enterprise, per presenter": "Pro o Enterprise, per relatore", "Large organisations": "Grandi organizzazioni", "Enterprise — custom": "Enterprise: su misura", "Prices in US dollars, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Prezzi in dollari USA, verificati il 7 ottobre 2026 sulla pagina prezzi di ciascuna azienda. Cambiano: verificali sulla", "our pricing page": "nostra pagina prezzi", "and Mentimeter's before you decide.": "e su quella di Mentimeter prima di decidere.", "If you'd rather build your entire presentation inside one interactive editor — and you don't already have a deck you want to keep — Mentimeter is a mature, well-designed choice with a big template library. It also has a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app available today; ours is in review with Microsoft. PollSlide shines when you want to keep your own slides — Keynote included — and add interactivity + AI on top.": "Se preferisci costruire l’intera presentazione dentro un unico editor interattivo, e non hai già una presentazione da tenere, Mentimeter è una scelta matura e ben progettata, con una grande libreria di modelli. Ha anche già un componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint desktop; il nostro è in revisione da parte di Microsoft. PollSlide dà il meglio quando vuoi tenere le tue slide, Keynote compreso, e aggiungere interattività + IA sopra.", "Questions people ask": "Domande frequenti", "Is PollSlide a good Mentimeter alternative?": "PollSlide è una buona alternativa a Mentimeter?", "Yes, if you want to keep presenting from your own slides. PollSlide adds live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top of Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF, instead of asking you to rebuild your presentation in a new editor. If you would rather build everything inside one interactive tool, Mentimeter is a strong choice.": "Sì, se vuoi continuare a presentare con le tue slide. PollSlide aggiunge sondaggi dal vivo, quiz, questionari e domande del pubblico sopra Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF, invece di costringerti a rifare la presentazione in un nuovo editor. Se preferisci creare tutto in un unico strumento interattivo, Mentimeter è un’ottima scelta.", "Can I keep using my PowerPoint or Keynote slides?": "Posso continuare a usare le mie slide di PowerPoint o Keynote?", "Yes. Paste your poll's QR code onto any slide and your audience answers on their phones. On a Mac, the free PollSlide companion floats live results over your slideshow — Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF — and shows the right poll when that slide is on screen.": "Sì. Incolla il codice QR del sondaggio su qualsiasi slide e il pubblico risponde dal telefono. Su Mac, l’app companion gratuita di PollSlide mostra i risultati dal vivo sopra la presentazione (Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF) e fa comparire il sondaggio giusto quando quella slide è sullo schermo.", "Does Mentimeter work inside PowerPoint?": "Mentimeter funziona dentro PowerPoint?", "Yes. Mentimeter offers a PowerPoint add-in for the desktop app on all its plans; according to its help center it does not run in PowerPoint online. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is built and in review with Microsoft, and the QR-on-slide method works in PowerPoint today.": "Sì. Mentimeter offre un componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint desktop in tutti i piani; secondo il suo centro assistenza non funziona in PowerPoint online. Il componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint di PollSlide è pronto ed è in revisione da parte di Microsoft, e il metodo del QR sulla slide funziona già in PowerPoint.", "How do PollSlide and Mentimeter prices compare?": "Come si confrontano i prezzi di PollSlide e Mentimeter?", "Both have a free plan. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually) and covers polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan. Mentimeter's paid plans are $11.99 (Basic) and $24.99 (Pro) per presenter per month, billed yearly. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "Entrambi hanno un piano gratuito. PollSlide Pro costa 12 $ al mese (10 $ con fatturazione annuale) e include sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio in un solo piano. I piani a pagamento di Mentimeter costano 11,99 $ (Basic) e 24,99 $ (Pro) per relatore al mese, con fatturazione annuale. Prezzi verificati il 7 ottobre 2026.", "Does my audience need to download an app?": "Il mio pubblico deve scaricare un’app?", "No — with either tool. In PollSlide, people scan the QR or go to pollslide.com/join and answer in their phone's browser, with no app and no account.": "No, con nessuno dei due strumenti. Con PollSlide le persone scansionano il QR o vanno su pollslide.com/join e rispondono dal browser del telefono, senza app e senza account.", "See also:": "Vedi anche:", "PollSlide for PowerPoint": "PollSlide per PowerPoint", "PollSlide for Keynote": "PollSlide per Keynote", "pricing": "prezzi", "game modes": "modalità di gioco", "study games": "giochi di studio", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Mentimeter and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Confronto basato su informazioni pubbliche, verificate il 7 ottobre 2026. Funzioni e prezzi dei concorrenti cambiano spesso: verificali sul loro sito. Mentimeter e gli altri nomi sono marchi dei rispettivi proprietari; questa pagina non è approvata da loro né affiliata con loro."}});
/* vs-slido / kahoot / poll-everywhere / ahaslides / wooclap — rebuilt + fully translated (facts checked 2026-10-07) */
;(function(H){for(var l in H){window.PS_I18N[l]=Object.assign(window.PS_I18N[l]||{},H[l]);}})({"es": {"Free plan available": "Plan gratuito disponible", "Paid one-time and annual plans — see slido.com/pricing": "Planes de pago puntuales y anuales: consulta slido.com/pricing", "Annual and enterprise plans": "Planes anuales y empresariales", "Prices in US dollars where shown, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Precios en dólares estadounidenses cuando se indican, comprobados el 7 de octubre de 2026 en la página de precios de cada empresa. Cambian: confírmalos en", "and the other company's before you decide.": "y en la de la otra empresa antes de decidir.", "Is PollSlide a good Slido alternative?": "¿Es PollSlide una buena alternativa a Slido?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A in one plan over the slides you already have. Slido is strongest for moderated Q&A in large meetings, especially in Webex. PollSlide adds graded quizzes with game modes, surveys and study sets, and works over Keynote as well as PowerPoint and Google Slides.": "Sí, si quieres encuestas, cuestionarios, formularios y preguntas del público en un solo plan sobre las diapositivas que ya tienes. Slido destaca en las preguntas moderadas de reuniones grandes, sobre todo en Webex. PollSlide añade cuestionarios con nota y modos de juego, formularios y sets de estudio, y funciona sobre Keynote además de PowerPoint y Google Slides.", "Does Slido work inside PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "¿Slido funciona dentro de PowerPoint y Google Slides?", "Yes. Slido offers a PowerPoint add-in and a Google Slides add-on, according to its help community. Its Mac Switcher app, which other presentation tools relied on, was retired in January 2025. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote.": "Sí. Según su comunidad de ayuda, Slido ofrece un complemento para PowerPoint y otro para Google Slides. Su app Switcher para Mac, en la que se apoyaban otras herramientas de presentación, se retiró en enero de 2025. El complemento de PowerPoint de PollSlide está en revisión por Microsoft; el método del QR en la diapositiva ya funciona en PowerPoint, Google Slides y Keynote.", "How do PollSlide and Slido prices compare?": "¿Cómo se comparan los precios de PollSlide y Slido?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Slido sells one-time and annual plans; check slido.com/pricing for current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide tiene un plan gratuito y Pro por 12 $ al mes (10 $ con facturación anual), con encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio. Slido vende planes puntuales y anuales; consulta slido.com/pricing para ver los precios actuales. Comprobado el 7 de octubre de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Slido and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparativa basada en información pública, comprobada el 7 de octubre de 2026. Las funciones y precios de la competencia cambian a menudo: verifícalos en su sitio. Slido y otros nombres son marcas de sus respectivos titulares; esta página no está respaldada por ellos ni afiliada a ellos.", "Kahoot! 360 Pro plans from $19/month, billed annually": "Planes Kahoot! 360 Pro desde 19 $/mes, con facturación anual", "Higher Pro tiers by participant count (up to 2,000+)": "Niveles Pro superiores según el número de participantes (hasta más de 2.000)", "Is PollSlide a good Kahoot alternative?": "¿Es PollSlide una buena alternativa a Kahoot?", "Yes, if you need more than a game-show quiz. PollSlide runs quizzes with game modes alongside real polls, open feedback, surveys and study sets, over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. For a pure high-energy quiz game, especially with younger students, Kahoot is purpose-built.": "Sí, si necesitas algo más que un concurso. PollSlide combina cuestionarios con modos de juego con encuestas de verdad, comentarios abiertos, formularios y sets de estudio, sobre tu propia presentación de Keynote, PowerPoint o Google Slides. Para un concurso puro y muy dinámico, sobre todo con alumnos pequeños, Kahoot está hecho a medida.", "Can Kahoot use my existing slides?": "¿Kahoot puede usar mis diapositivas actuales?", "Kahoot! 360 can import PowerPoint, Keynote and PDF files, and its Pro Standard plan and above sync with PowerPoint and Google Slides, according to its pricing page. PollSlide works over the original deck itself: paste a QR on any slide, and the Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF.": "Según su página de precios, Kahoot! 360 puede importar archivos de PowerPoint, Keynote y PDF, y a partir del plan Pro Standard se sincroniza con PowerPoint y Google Slides. PollSlide funciona sobre la propia presentación original: pega un QR en cualquier diapositiva y la app complementaria para Mac muestra los resultados en directo sobre Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF.", "How do PollSlide and Kahoot prices compare?": "¿Cómo se comparan los precios de PollSlide y Kahoot?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Kahoot! 360 Pro plans start at $19 a month billed annually, with higher tiers for more participants. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide tiene un plan gratuito y Pro por 12 $ al mes (10 $ con facturación anual), con encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio. Los planes Kahoot! 360 Pro empiezan en 19 $ al mes con facturación anual, con niveles superiores para más participantes. Precios comprobados el 7 de octubre de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Kahoot and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparativa basada en información pública, comprobada el 7 de octubre de 2026. Las funciones y precios de la competencia cambian a menudo: verifícalos en su sitio. Kahoot y otros nombres son marcas de sus respectivos titulares; esta página no está respaldada por ellos ni afiliada a ellos.", "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere — the honest comparison": "PollSlide frente a Poll Everywhere: la comparativa honesta", "vs Poll Everywhere": "frente a Poll Everywhere", "Poll Everywhere has run live classroom and meeting polls since 2007, with deep Canvas gradebook integration and SMS voting built in. PollSlide takes a different route: one QR you paste onto any slide, in any tool, plus AI that drafts from your own material and a full quiz-and-study suite in one plan.": "Poll Everywhere lleva desde 2007 haciendo encuestas en directo en clases y reuniones, con una integración profunda con el libro de notas de Canvas y votación por SMS. PollSlide toma otro camino: un QR que pegas en cualquier diapositiva, en cualquier herramienta, más una IA que redacta a partir de tu propio material y un conjunto completo de cuestionarios y estudio en un solo plan.", "Poll Everywhere is a mature, institutional tool — its Canvas gradebook integration and SMS text-in fallback are genuinely hard to match, especially for large campus lecture classes. PollSlide is built for presenters who don't want to insert activity slides into their deck at all: paste one QR box onto any existing slide, run polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets from a single plan, and let Polly AI draft from a PDF or your own notes instead of just a typed topic.": "Poll Everywhere es una herramienta madura e institucional: su integración con el libro de notas de Canvas y la votación por SMS son difíciles de igualar, sobre todo en grandes clases universitarias. PollSlide está pensado para quien no quiere insertar diapositivas de actividades en su presentación: pega un bloque QR en cualquier diapositiva existente, haz encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio con un solo plan, y deja que Polly AI redacte a partir de un PDF o de tus notas, no solo de un tema escrito.", "Works the same way on Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF — one method": "Funciona igual en Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF: un solo método", "Copy a QR box onto any slide in any tool; nothing to rebuild": "Copia un bloque QR en cualquier diapositiva de cualquier herramienta; nada que rehacer", "Separate native integrations per app; importing a deck into a different tool can break already-embedded activities": "Integraciones nativas distintas para cada app; importar una presentación a otra herramienta puede romper las actividades ya insertadas", "Native add-in already published for your slide app": "Complemento nativo ya publicado para tu app de presentaciones", "PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; Google Slides integration is planned, not shipped": "El complemento de PowerPoint está en revisión por Microsoft; la integración con Google Slides está prevista, aún no disponible", "Native PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) and Google Slides integrations, plus a Live App overlay for other software": "Integraciones nativas con PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) y Google Slides, más una superposición Live App para otros programas", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets — one product": "Encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio: un solo producto", "Built around live, synchronous activities; no documented async study/review mode": "Diseñado para actividades en directo y síncronas; sin modo documentado de estudio o repaso asíncrono", "AI drafts questions from your own PDF or notes": "La IA redacta preguntas a partir de tu propio PDF o tus notas", "Polly AI works from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or pasted notes": "Polly AI trabaja a partir de un tema, un PDF subido o notas pegadas", "Generates multiple-choice questions from a typed topic; no documented ability to read an uploaded deck or PDF": "Genera preguntas de opción múltiple a partir de un tema escrito; no consta que pueda leer una presentación o un PDF subido", "AI turns open-text answers into themes + sentiment": "La IA convierte las respuestas abiertas en temas + sentimiento", "SMS text-in voting (no app, no data plan needed)": "Votación por SMS (sin app ni datos móviles)", "A real advantage for audiences with limited phone data or no ability to install anything": "Una ventaja real para públicos con pocos datos móviles o sin posibilidad de instalar nada", "Native LMS gradebook integration (e.g. Canvas)": "Integración nativa con el libro de notas del LMS (p. ej., Canvas)", "Deep higher-ed install base, with roster import for attendance": "Gran implantación en educación superior, con importación de listas para la asistencia", "Free companion app floats results over your presentation automatically": "La app complementaria gratuita muestra los resultados sobre tu presentación automáticamente", "macOS only today; the QR-on-slide method itself needs zero install on any OS": "Hoy solo para macOS; el método del QR en la diapositiva no necesita instalar nada en ningún sistema", "A Live App overlay covers other software; the deepest experience is inside their own native add-ins": "Una superposición Live App cubre otros programas; la experiencia más completa está en sus propios complementos nativos", "Free tier for real sessions": "Plan gratuito para sesiones reales", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, 5 Polly generations/month — no card required": "3 presentaciones guardadas, 25 participantes por sesión, 5 generaciones de Polly al mes; sin tarjeta", "Free \"Intro\" plan: up to 40 people (700 for the first 30 days), per its plans page": "Plan gratuito «Intro»: hasta 40 personas (700 durante los primeros 30 días), según su página de planes", "Team quiz scoring rewards accuracy, not just table size": "La puntuación por equipos premia la precisión, no solo el tamaño del grupo", "Score averages per player, so a bigger team doesn't automatically win": "La puntuación es la media por jugador, así que un equipo más grande no gana automáticamente", "Scoring mechanics for their team competitions aren't publicly documented": "Las reglas de puntuación de sus competiciones por equipos no están documentadas públicamente", "One method, every deck": "Un método, cualquier presentación", "Paste a QR box onto any slide in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF and present as normal — no add-in to install, and nothing to rebuild if you switch tools later.": "Pega un bloque QR en cualquier diapositiva de Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF y presenta como siempre: sin complementos que instalar ni nada que rehacer si más adelante cambias de herramienta.", "AI that reads your material": "IA que lee tu material", "Polly drafts questions from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or your own notes — and turns open-text answers into themes and sentiment as they come in.": "Polly redacta preguntas a partir de un tema, un PDF subido o tus propias notas, y convierte las respuestas abiertas en temas y sentimiento a medida que llegan.", "One suite, one plan": "Una suite, un plan", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions.": "Encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio en un solo plan, con un plan gratuito que permite sesiones reales.", "Free — up to 40 people per poll": "Gratis: hasta 40 personas por encuesta", "Present — $10/month, or $120 billed annually": "Present: 10 $/mes, o 120 $ con facturación anual", "Engage and Teams plans, priced per organisation": "Planes Engage y Teams, con precio por organización", "🤝 When Poll Everywhere might be the better fit": "🤝 Cuándo Poll Everywhere puede encajar mejor", "Poll Everywhere has been refining live classroom and meeting polling since 2007, and it shows: campuses standardized on Canvas get native gradebook and roster integration that PollSlide doesn't offer, and SMS text-in voting is a genuine fallback for audiences without reliable phone data or the ability to install anything. If that institutional depth — or a text-in option — is what you need, Poll Everywhere is worth a look. PollSlide is the better fit when you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study in one plan, AI that works from your own material, and nothing to rebuild when you switch presentation tools.": "Poll Everywhere lleva desde 2007 perfeccionando las encuestas en directo para clases y reuniones, y se nota: los campus que usan Canvas tienen una integración nativa con el libro de notas y las listas que PollSlide no ofrece, y la votación por SMS es una alternativa real para públicos sin datos fiables o sin posibilidad de instalar nada. Si necesitas esa profundidad institucional, o votar por SMS, vale la pena mirar Poll Everywhere. PollSlide encaja mejor cuando quieres encuestas, cuestionarios, formularios y estudio en un solo plan, una IA que trabaja con tu propio material y nada que rehacer al cambiar de herramienta de presentación.", "Is PollSlide a good Poll Everywhere alternative?": "¿Es PollSlide una buena alternativa a Poll Everywhere?", "Yes, if you want polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan, plus AI that turns open answers into themes. Poll Everywhere is a long-established choice with SMS text-in voting and deep LMS integration, which PollSlide does not offer.": "Sí, si quieres encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio en un solo plan, además de una IA que convierte las respuestas abiertas en temas. Poll Everywhere es una opción veterana con votación por SMS e integración profunda con LMS, que PollSlide no ofrece.", "Does Poll Everywhere work inside PowerPoint and Keynote?": "¿Poll Everywhere funciona dentro de PowerPoint y Keynote?", "Yes. Poll Everywhere lists PowerPoint integration on all its plans and offers a presenter add-in for PowerPoint and Keynote on Mac. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF with a QR on the slide; its PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft.": "Sí. Poll Everywhere incluye integración con PowerPoint en todos sus planes y ofrece un complemento para PowerPoint y Keynote en Mac. PollSlide funciona sobre Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF con un QR en la diapositiva; su complemento de PowerPoint está en revisión por Microsoft.", "How do PollSlide and Poll Everywhere prices compare?": "¿Cómo se comparan los precios de PollSlide y Poll Everywhere?", "PollSlide has a free plan for 25 participants per session and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually). Poll Everywhere's free plan allows up to 40 people, and its Present plan is $10 a month or $120 billed annually, priced per organisation. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide tiene un plan gratuito para 25 participantes por sesión y Pro por 12 $ al mes (10 $ con facturación anual). El plan gratuito de Poll Everywhere permite hasta 40 personas, y su plan Present cuesta 10 $ al mes o 120 $ con facturación anual, con precio por organización. Comprobado el 7 de octubre de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Poll Everywhere and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparativa basada en información pública, comprobada el 7 de octubre de 2026. Las funciones y precios de la competencia cambian a menudo: verifícalos en su sitio. Poll Everywhere y otros nombres son marcas de sus respectivos titulares; esta página no está respaldada por ellos ni afiliada a ellos.", "PollSlide vs AhaSlides — the honest comparison": "PollSlide frente a AhaSlides: la comparativa honesta", "vs AhaSlides": "frente a AhaSlides", "AhaSlides packs polls, quizzes, word clouds, brainstorm boards and more into its own online editor, with real AI question generation built in. PollSlide takes a different bet: your own Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or PDF stays exactly as you built it, with a QR on the slide as the one method that works on every surface — Keynote included.": "AhaSlides reúne encuestas, cuestionarios, nubes de palabras, tableros de ideas y más en su propio editor en línea, con generación de preguntas por IA integrada. PollSlide apuesta por otra cosa: tu propio Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o PDF se queda exactamente como lo hiciste, con un QR en la diapositiva como el único método que funciona en todas partes, Keynote incluido.", "AhaSlides is a genuinely broad, easy-to-use interaction platform — if you're happy building or importing your content into its own editor. PollSlide is built around the opposite bet: you keep presenting your original deck, unchanged, from any app including Keynote, while Polly AI drafts the questions and a QR on the slide is the one method that works everywhere without an install.": "AhaSlides es una plataforma de interacción realmente amplia y fácil de usar, si no te importa crear o importar tu contenido en su propio editor. PollSlide se basa en la apuesta contraria: sigues presentando tu presentación original, sin cambios, desde cualquier app incluida Keynote, mientras Polly AI redacta las preguntas y un QR en la diapositiva es el único método que funciona en todas partes sin instalar nada.", "Presents from your existing Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF, unmodified": "Presenta desde tu Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF actual, sin modificarlo", "Imports convert slides to static images inside AhaSlides' own editor": "Las importaciones convierten las diapositivas en imágenes estáticas dentro del editor de AhaSlides", "Works with Keynote at all": "Funciona con Keynote", "QR-on-slide works everywhere; free Mac companion floats results on top": "El QR en la diapositiva funciona en todas partes; la app complementaria gratuita para Mac muestra los resultados encima", "No Keynote add-in — an open, undated request on AhaSlides' own forum": "Sin complemento para Keynote: una petición abierta y sin fecha en el propio foro de AhaSlides", "Library of interaction types (word clouds, brainstorm boards, spinner wheel, rating scales)": "Biblioteca de tipos de interacción (nubes de palabras, tableros de ideas, ruleta, escalas de valoración)", "From a topic, notes, or a PDF": "A partir de un tema, notas o un PDF", "From an uploaded PDF, PPT, Word or Excel file": "A partir de un archivo PDF, PPT, Word o Excel subido", "Free tier that runs a full, real session": "Plan gratuito que permite una sesión real completa", "25 participants, 5 Polly AI generations/month, no card": "25 participantes, 5 generaciones de Polly AI al mes, sin tarjeta", "50 participants, but capped at 5 quiz + 3 poll questions per presentation": "50 participantes, pero con un máximo de 5 preguntas de cuestionario + 3 de encuesta por presentación", "Imports keep your animations, embedded audio/video and links": "Las importaciones conservan tus animaciones, audio/vídeo incrustado y enlaces", "Nothing to import — you present the original file": "Nada que importar: presentas el archivo original", "Import strips animations, audio/video and links (50MB / 100-slide limit)": "La importación elimina animaciones, audio/vídeo y enlaces (límite de 50 MB / 100 diapositivas)", "Tiered per-plan pricing; verify current terms on their site": "Precios por niveles según el plan; consulta las condiciones actuales en su sitio", "Keep your slides, exactly as built": "Conserva tus diapositivas tal como las hiciste", "PollSlide floats a QR over the deck you already made — Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, a PDF. Nothing gets rebuilt or converted into static images inside someone else's editor.": "PollSlide coloca un QR sobre la presentación que ya hiciste: Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF. Nada se rehace ni se convierte en imágenes estáticas dentro del editor de otro.", "Actually works on Keynote": "Funciona de verdad en Keynote", "Keynote has no public plugin ecosystem, so the QR-on-slide method plus a free Mac companion app is the real, shipped answer — not an open feature request.": "Keynote no tiene un ecosistema público de complementos, así que el método del QR en la diapositiva y una app complementaria gratuita para Mac son la respuesta real y disponible, no una petición pendiente.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions — not a handful of questions to test the water.": "Encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y sets de estudio en un solo plan, con un plan gratuito que permite sesiones reales, no un puñado de preguntas para probar.", "Free — 50 participants, a few quiz and poll questions per presentation": "Gratis: 50 participantes, unas pocas preguntas de cuestionario y encuesta por presentación", "Paid plans billed monthly or yearly — see ahaslides.com/pricing": "Planes de pago con facturación mensual o anual: consulta ahaslides.com/pricing", "Team plans with volume discounts": "Planes de equipo con descuentos por volumen", "🤝 When AhaSlides might be the better fit": "🤝 Cuándo AhaSlides puede encajar mejor", "If you want the widest single toolbox of interaction types — word clouds, brainstorm boards, a spinner wheel, rating scales — built and templated inside one polished editor, AhaSlides already ships all of that, and its AI question generator and PowerPoint add-in are live today, not in review. PollSlide is the better fit when presenting your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — matters more to you than that breadth of interaction types.": "Si quieres la caja de herramientas más amplia de tipos de interacción (nubes de palabras, tableros de ideas, ruleta, escalas de valoración) dentro de un editor pulido y con plantillas, AhaSlides ya lo ofrece todo, y su generador de preguntas con IA y su complemento de PowerPoint ya están disponibles, no en revisión. PollSlide encaja mejor cuando presentar tu propia presentación tal como la hiciste, Keynote incluido, te importa más que esa variedad de interacciones.", "Is PollSlide a good AhaSlides alternative?": "¿Es PollSlide una buena alternativa a AhaSlides?", "Yes, if you want to present your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — with live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top. AhaSlides has a wider toolbox of interaction types inside its own editor, and a PowerPoint add-in available today.": "Sí, si quieres presentar tu propia presentación tal como la hiciste, Keynote incluido, con encuestas en directo, cuestionarios, formularios y preguntas del público encima. AhaSlides tiene una caja de herramientas más amplia dentro de su propio editor y un complemento de PowerPoint ya disponible.", "Does AhaSlides work with PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "¿AhaSlides funciona con PowerPoint y Google Slides?", "Yes. According to its pricing page you can import PowerPoint slides into AhaSlides or add AhaSlides to a PowerPoint presentation with its add-in, and it integrates with Google Slides. Keynote is not mentioned. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF.": "Sí. Según su página de precios, puedes importar diapositivas de PowerPoint a AhaSlides o añadir AhaSlides a una presentación de PowerPoint con su complemento, y se integra con Google Slides. Keynote no se menciona. PollSlide funciona sobre Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF.", "How do PollSlide and AhaSlides prices compare?": "¿Cómo se comparan los precios de PollSlide y AhaSlides?", "Both have a free plan: PollSlide's runs real sessions for 25 participants, AhaSlides' allows 50 participants with a few quiz and poll questions per presentation. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); check ahaslides.com/pricing for its current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Los dos tienen plan gratuito: el de PollSlide permite sesiones reales con 25 participantes y el de AhaSlides permite 50 participantes con unas pocas preguntas de cuestionario y encuesta por presentación. PollSlide Pro cuesta 12 $ al mes (10 $ con facturación anual); consulta ahaslides.com/pricing para sus precios actuales. Comprobado el 7 de octubre de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. AhaSlides and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparativa basada en información pública, comprobada el 7 de octubre de 2026. Las funciones y precios de la competencia cambian a menudo: verifícalos en su sitio. AhaSlides y otros nombres son marcas de sus respectivos titulares; esta página no está respaldada por ellos ni afiliada a ellos.", "PollSlide vs Wooclap — the honest comparison": "PollSlide frente a Wooclap: la comparativa honesta", "vs Wooclap": "frente a Wooclap", "Wooclap packs in 20+ question types and deep LMS/SSO integrations — but it asks you to build your session in its own editor, or let its add-in insert its own slides into PowerPoint or Google Slides. PollSlide asks for none of that: paste a QR box on the slide you already made, in any app, and results appear on top.": "Wooclap reúne más de 20 tipos de preguntas e integraciones profundas con LMS/SSO, pero te pide crear la sesión en su propio editor o dejar que su complemento inserte sus propias diapositivas en PowerPoint o Google Slides. PollSlide no te pide nada de eso: pega un bloque QR en la diapositiva que ya hiciste, en cualquier app, y los resultados aparecen encima.", "Wooclap is a mature, feature-rich platform for building a session inside its own event editor — or inserting its interactive slides into PowerPoint (native add-in) or Google Slides (browser extension) — with a big question-type library and real LMS/SSO wiring for schools and enterprise. PollSlide takes the opposite approach: your existing Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides or PDF deck never gets touched or converted — a QR box you paste onto any slide is the whole integration, and one free Mac companion floats results over whatever app you're already presenting from.": "Wooclap es una plataforma madura y completa para crear una sesión en su propio editor de eventos, o insertar sus diapositivas interactivas en PowerPoint (complemento nativo) o Google Slides (extensión del navegador), con una gran biblioteca de tipos de preguntas y conexión real con LMS/SSO para centros educativos y empresas. PollSlide hace lo contrario: tu presentación de Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides o PDF nunca se toca ni se convierte; un bloque QR pegado en cualquier diapositiva es toda la integración, y una app complementaria gratuita para Mac muestra los resultados sobre la app desde la que ya presentas.", "Your original deck stays completely untouched": "Tu presentación original queda completamente intacta", "No import, no conversion, no inserted slides": "Sin importar, sin convertir, sin diapositivas insertadas", "PowerPoint/Slides work by inserting Wooclap's own slides into your deck": "En PowerPoint/Slides funciona insertando las propias diapositivas de Wooclap en tu presentación", "Keynote keeps its native animations, video & links": "Keynote conserva sus animaciones, vídeos y enlaces nativos", "Your Keynote file is never converted": "Tu archivo de Keynote nunca se convierte", "Wooclap's own docs group Keynote with PDF uploads — converted to static images, losing animations, hyperlinks and video": "La propia documentación de Wooclap agrupa Keynote con las subidas de PDF: se convierte en imágenes estáticas y se pierden animaciones, enlaces y vídeo", "Background companion overlays results on any app": "Una app complementaria en segundo plano muestra los resultados sobre cualquier app", "Free Mac menu-bar app floats results over Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF automatically": "Una app gratuita en la barra de menús del Mac muestra los resultados sobre Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF automáticamente", "Live results only appear inside Wooclap's web player, PowerPoint pane, or its own inserted slides": "Los resultados en directo solo aparecen en el reproductor web de Wooclap, su panel de PowerPoint o sus propias diapositivas insertadas", "Native PowerPoint add-in": "Complemento nativo para PowerPoint", "A native Office add-in is in review with Microsoft, not yet published": "Un complemento nativo de Office está en revisión por Microsoft, aún sin publicar", "Established add-in, in use today": "Complemento consolidado, en uso hoy", "LMS sync & SSO/SAML for institutions": "Sincronización con LMS y SSO/SAML para instituciones", "Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard sync, SSO/SAML/CAS on enterprise tiers": "Sincronización con Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard y SSO/SAML/CAS en los niveles empresariales", "No install or account needed for your audience": "Tu público no necesita instalar nada ni crear cuenta", "AI drafts questions from your content": "La IA redacta preguntas a partir de tu contenido", "From a topic, a PDF, or your own notes — plus matching images": "A partir de un tema, un PDF o tus propias notas, con imágenes a juego", "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard generates from an uploaded document, PDF, audio/video or URL": "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard genera a partir de un documento, PDF, audio/vídeo o URL", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study — one flat plan": "Encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios y estudio: un único plan", "One platform, but export, unlimited questions, AI and branding are split across Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate tiers": "Una plataforma, pero la exportación, las preguntas ilimitadas, la IA y la marca se reparten entre los niveles Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate", "Free tier with no rolling question cap": "Plan gratuito sin límite periódico de preguntas", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, no credit card": "3 presentaciones guardadas, 25 participantes por sesión, sin tarjeta", "Free Starter caps active questions at 5 per rolling 30-day period, and doesn't allow exporting results": "El plan gratuito Starter limita las preguntas activas a 5 cada 30 días y no permite exportar resultados", "Breadth of built-in question-type formats": "Variedad de formatos de pregunta integrados", "Covers the core interactive types": "Cubre los tipos interactivos esenciales", "20+ formats — word cloud, ranking, matching, brainstorming, spin-the-wheel and more": "Más de 20 formatos: nube de palabras, ranking, emparejar, lluvia de ideas, ruleta y más", "Your deck stays exactly as you built it": "Tu presentación queda exactamente como la hiciste", "No exporting into Wooclap's editor, no letting an add-in insert someone else's slides, no Keynote file getting flattened into static images. Paste a QR box on the slide you already made and present like you always do.": "Sin exportar al editor de Wooclap, sin dejar que un complemento inserte diapositivas ajenas, sin que tu archivo de Keynote se convierta en imágenes estáticas. Pega un bloque QR en la diapositiva que ya hiciste y presenta como siempre.", "One companion, not an add-in per app": "Una app complementaria, no un complemento por cada app", "The free Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF automatically — no add-in pane to manage, no browser extension, no separate web player to babysit.": "La app complementaria gratuita para Mac muestra los resultados en directo sobre Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF automáticamente: sin panel de complemento que gestionar, sin extensión del navegador y sin un reproductor web aparte que vigilar.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes, study — one price": "Encuestas, formularios, cuestionarios, estudio: un solo precio", "Everything runs on a single flat plan with a free tier that runs real sessions, not a Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate ladder where exporting and AI sit behind higher tiers.": "Todo funciona con un único plan, con un plan gratuito que permite sesiones reales, no una escalera Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate donde la exportación y la IA están en los niveles superiores.", "Free Starter plan — 5 questions a month": "Plan gratuito Starter: 5 preguntas al mes", "Basic and Pro plans, billed annually — see wooclap.com/pricing": "Planes Basic y Pro con facturación anual: consulta wooclap.com/pricing", "Corporate from 6 presenters": "Corporate a partir de 6 presentadores", "Campus and corporate — custom": "Campus y empresas: a medida", "🤝 When Wooclap might be the better fit": "🤝 Cuándo Wooclap puede encajar mejor", "Wooclap's library of 20+ interactive question types — word clouds, ranking, matching, brainstorming boards, spin-the-wheel and more — goes well beyond a typical live-polling tool, and its LMS sync (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) plus SSO/SAML/CAS make it a genuinely strong fit for IT-managed school or enterprise rollouts. If that specific breadth or institutional wiring is what you need, Wooclap is worth a look.": "La biblioteca de más de 20 tipos de preguntas interactivas de Wooclap (nubes de palabras, ranking, emparejar, tableros de ideas, ruleta y más) va mucho más allá de una herramienta de encuestas típica, y su sincronización con LMS (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) junto con SSO/SAML/CAS la hacen muy adecuada para despliegues gestionados por el equipo de TI en centros educativos o empresas. Si necesitas esa variedad o esa conexión institucional, vale la pena mirar Wooclap.", "Is PollSlide a good Wooclap alternative?": "¿Es PollSlide una buena alternativa a Wooclap?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study sets in one flat plan over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. Wooclap has a broad library of question types and LMS sync with SSO, which suits IT-managed school and enterprise rollouts.": "Sí, si quieres encuestas, cuestionarios, formularios y sets de estudio en un único plan sobre tu propia presentación de Keynote, PowerPoint o Google Slides. Wooclap tiene una amplia biblioteca de tipos de preguntas y sincronización con LMS y SSO, que encaja con despliegues gestionados por TI en centros educativos y empresas.", "Does Wooclap work inside PowerPoint?": "¿Wooclap funciona dentro de PowerPoint?", "Yes. Wooclap says it works with PowerPoint, Google Slides and Microsoft Teams. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote, and the Mac companion floats live results over any deck.": "Sí. Wooclap indica que funciona con PowerPoint, Google Slides y Microsoft Teams. El complemento de PowerPoint de PollSlide está en revisión por Microsoft; el método del QR en la diapositiva ya funciona en PowerPoint, Google Slides y Keynote, y la app complementaria para Mac muestra los resultados en directo sobre cualquier presentación.", "How do PollSlide and Wooclap prices compare?": "¿Cómo se comparan los precios de PollSlide y Wooclap?", "Both have a free plan. Wooclap's Starter plan allows 5 questions a month; PollSlide's free plan runs full sessions for 25 participants. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); Wooclap's paid plans are billed annually — check wooclap.com/pricing. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Los dos tienen plan gratuito. El plan Starter de Wooclap permite 5 preguntas al mes; el plan gratuito de PollSlide permite sesiones completas con 25 participantes. PollSlide Pro cuesta 12 $ al mes (10 $ con facturación anual); los planes de pago de Wooclap se facturan anualmente: consulta wooclap.com/pricing. Comprobado el 7 de octubre de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Wooclap's features and pricing change often — please verify current details on their site. Wooclap and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparativa basada en información pública, comprobada el 7 de octubre de 2026. Las funciones y precios de Wooclap cambian a menudo: verifica los datos actuales en su sitio. Wooclap y otros nombres son marcas de sus respectivos titulares; esta página no está respaldada por ellos ni afiliada a ellos."}, "de": {"Free plan available": "Kostenloser Tarif verfügbar", "Paid one-time and annual plans — see slido.com/pricing": "Bezahlte Einmal- und Jahrestarife – siehe slido.com/pricing", "Annual and enterprise plans": "Jahres- und Unternehmenstarife", "Prices in US dollars where shown, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Preise in US-Dollar, sofern angegeben, am 7. Oktober 2026 auf der jeweiligen Preisseite geprüft. Sie ändern sich – bitte prüf sie auf", "and the other company's before you decide.": "und der des anderen Anbieters, bevor du dich entscheidest.", "Is PollSlide a good Slido alternative?": "Ist PollSlide eine gute Alternative zu Slido?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A in one plan over the slides you already have. Slido is strongest for moderated Q&A in large meetings, especially in Webex. PollSlide adds graded quizzes with game modes, surveys and study sets, and works over Keynote as well as PowerPoint and Google Slides.": "Ja, wenn du Umfragen, Quizze, Befragungen und Publikumsfragen in einem Tarif über deinen vorhandenen Folien willst. Slido ist am stärksten bei moderierten Fragerunden in großen Meetings, besonders in Webex. PollSlide bietet zusätzlich bewertete Quizze mit Spielmodi, Befragungen und Lernsets und funktioniert über Keynote ebenso wie über PowerPoint und Google Slides.", "Does Slido work inside PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "Funktioniert Slido in PowerPoint und Google Slides?", "Yes. Slido offers a PowerPoint add-in and a Google Slides add-on, according to its help community. Its Mac Switcher app, which other presentation tools relied on, was retired in January 2025. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote.": "Ja. Laut seiner Hilfe-Community bietet Slido ein Add-in für PowerPoint und eines für Google Slides. Seine Mac-App Switcher, auf die andere Präsentationsprogramme angewiesen waren, wurde im Januar 2025 eingestellt. Das PowerPoint-Add-in von PollSlide wird von Microsoft geprüft; der QR-Code auf der Folie funktioniert schon heute in PowerPoint, Google Slides und Keynote.", "How do PollSlide and Slido prices compare?": "Wie unterscheiden sich die Preise von PollSlide und Slido?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Slido sells one-time and annual plans; check slido.com/pricing for current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide hat einen kostenlosen Tarif und Pro für 12 $ im Monat (10 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung) mit Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizzen und Lernsets. Slido verkauft Einmal- und Jahrestarife; aktuelle Preise unter slido.com/pricing. Geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Slido and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Vergleich auf Basis öffentlich verfügbarer Informationen, geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026. Funktionen und Preise der Mitbewerber ändern sich oft – bitte auf deren Website prüfen. Slido und andere Namen sind Marken ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber; diese Seite wird von ihnen weder unterstützt noch steht sie mit ihnen in Verbindung.", "Kahoot! 360 Pro plans from $19/month, billed annually": "Kahoot! 360 Pro ab 19 $/Monat, jährliche Abrechnung", "Higher Pro tiers by participant count (up to 2,000+)": "Höhere Pro-Stufen nach Teilnehmerzahl (bis über 2.000)", "Is PollSlide a good Kahoot alternative?": "Ist PollSlide eine gute Alternative zu Kahoot?", "Yes, if you need more than a game-show quiz. PollSlide runs quizzes with game modes alongside real polls, open feedback, surveys and study sets, over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. For a pure high-energy quiz game, especially with younger students, Kahoot is purpose-built.": "Ja, wenn du mehr als eine Quizshow brauchst. PollSlide verbindet Quizze mit Spielmodi mit echten Umfragen, offenem Feedback, Befragungen und Lernsets – über deinem eigenen Keynote-, PowerPoint- oder Google-Slides-Deck. Für ein reines, temporeiches Quizspiel, besonders mit jüngeren Schüler:innen, ist Kahoot genau dafür gemacht.", "Can Kahoot use my existing slides?": "Kann Kahoot meine vorhandenen Folien nutzen?", "Kahoot! 360 can import PowerPoint, Keynote and PDF files, and its Pro Standard plan and above sync with PowerPoint and Google Slides, according to its pricing page. PollSlide works over the original deck itself: paste a QR on any slide, and the Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF.": "Laut Preisseite kann Kahoot! 360 PowerPoint-, Keynote- und PDF-Dateien importieren, und ab dem Tarif Pro Standard synchronisiert es mit PowerPoint und Google Slides. PollSlide arbeitet direkt über dem Original-Deck: QR-Code auf eine beliebige Folie, und die Mac-Begleit-App blendet Live-Ergebnisse über Keynote, PowerPoint oder ein PDF ein.", "How do PollSlide and Kahoot prices compare?": "Wie unterscheiden sich die Preise von PollSlide und Kahoot?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Kahoot! 360 Pro plans start at $19 a month billed annually, with higher tiers for more participants. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide hat einen kostenlosen Tarif und Pro für 12 $ im Monat (10 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung) mit Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizzen und Lernsets. Kahoot! 360 Pro beginnt bei 19 $ im Monat bei jährlicher Abrechnung, mit höheren Stufen für mehr Teilnehmende. Preise geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Kahoot and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Vergleich auf Basis öffentlich verfügbarer Informationen, geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026. Funktionen und Preise der Mitbewerber ändern sich oft – bitte auf deren Website prüfen. Kahoot und andere Namen sind Marken ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber; diese Seite wird von ihnen weder unterstützt noch steht sie mit ihnen in Verbindung.", "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs. Poll Everywhere – der ehrliche Vergleich", "vs Poll Everywhere": "vs. Poll Everywhere", "Poll Everywhere has run live classroom and meeting polls since 2007, with deep Canvas gradebook integration and SMS voting built in. PollSlide takes a different route: one QR you paste onto any slide, in any tool, plus AI that drafts from your own material and a full quiz-and-study suite in one plan.": "Poll Everywhere macht seit 2007 Live-Umfragen in Unterricht und Meetings, mit tiefer Canvas-Notenbuch-Integration und SMS-Abstimmung. PollSlide geht einen anderen Weg: ein QR-Code, den du auf jede Folie in jedem Programm setzt, dazu KI, die aus deinem eigenen Material entwirft, und eine komplette Quiz- und Lernsuite in einem Tarif.", "Poll Everywhere is a mature, institutional tool — its Canvas gradebook integration and SMS text-in fallback are genuinely hard to match, especially for large campus lecture classes. PollSlide is built for presenters who don't want to insert activity slides into their deck at all: paste one QR box onto any existing slide, run polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets from a single plan, and let Polly AI draft from a PDF or your own notes instead of just a typed topic.": "Poll Everywhere ist ein ausgereiftes Werkzeug für Institutionen – seine Canvas-Notenbuch-Integration und die SMS-Abstimmung sind schwer zu schlagen, besonders in großen Hochschulvorlesungen. PollSlide ist für Vortragende gemacht, die gar keine Aktivitätsfolien in ihr Deck einfügen wollen: Füge einen QR-Block auf eine vorhandene Folie ein, mach Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze und Lernsets mit einem Tarif und lass Polly AI aus einem PDF oder deinen Notizen entwerfen statt nur aus einem eingetippten Thema.", "Works the same way on Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF — one method": "Funktioniert gleich in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides oder einem PDF – eine Methode", "Copy a QR box onto any slide in any tool; nothing to rebuild": "Einen QR-Block auf jede Folie in jedem Programm kopieren; nichts neu bauen", "Separate native integrations per app; importing a deck into a different tool can break already-embedded activities": "Getrennte native Integrationen je App; ein Deck in ein anderes Programm zu importieren kann eingebettete Aktivitäten zerstören", "Native add-in already published for your slide app": "Natives Add-in für dein Präsentationsprogramm bereits veröffentlicht", "PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; Google Slides integration is planned, not shipped": "Das PowerPoint-Add-in wird von Microsoft geprüft; die Google-Slides-Integration ist geplant, noch nicht verfügbar", "Native PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) and Google Slides integrations, plus a Live App overlay for other software": "Native Integrationen für PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) und Google Slides, dazu ein Live-App-Overlay für andere Software", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets — one product": "Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze und Lernsets – ein Produkt", "Built around live, synchronous activities; no documented async study/review mode": "Auf Live-Aktivitäten ausgelegt; kein dokumentierter asynchroner Lern- oder Wiederholungsmodus", "AI drafts questions from your own PDF or notes": "KI entwirft Fragen aus deinem eigenen PDF oder deinen Notizen", "Polly AI works from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or pasted notes": "Polly AI arbeitet mit einem Thema, einem hochgeladenen PDF oder eingefügten Notizen", "Generates multiple-choice questions from a typed topic; no documented ability to read an uploaded deck or PDF": "Erstellt Multiple-Choice-Fragen aus einem eingetippten Thema; keine dokumentierte Möglichkeit, ein hochgeladenes Deck oder PDF zu lesen", "AI turns open-text answers into themes + sentiment": "KI macht aus offenen Antworten Themen + Stimmung", "SMS text-in voting (no app, no data plan needed)": "Abstimmung per SMS (ohne App und mobile Daten)", "A real advantage for audiences with limited phone data or no ability to install anything": "Ein echter Vorteil für Publikum mit wenig mobilen Daten oder ohne Möglichkeit, etwas zu installieren", "Native LMS gradebook integration (e.g. Canvas)": "Native Integration ins LMS-Notenbuch (z. B. Canvas)", "Deep higher-ed install base, with roster import for attendance": "Breite Verbreitung an Hochschulen, mit Import von Teilnehmerlisten für die Anwesenheit", "Free companion app floats results over your presentation automatically": "Die kostenlose Begleit-App blendet Ergebnisse automatisch über deiner Präsentation ein", "macOS only today; the QR-on-slide method itself needs zero install on any OS": "Heute nur macOS; der QR-Code auf der Folie braucht auf keinem System eine Installation", "A Live App overlay covers other software; the deepest experience is inside their own native add-ins": "Ein Live-App-Overlay deckt andere Software ab; das beste Erlebnis gibt es in den eigenen nativen Add-ins", "Free tier for real sessions": "Kostenloser Tarif für echte Sitzungen", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, 5 Polly generations/month — no card required": "3 gespeicherte Decks, 25 Teilnehmende pro Sitzung, 5 Polly-Generierungen pro Monat – ohne Karte", "Free \"Intro\" plan: up to 40 people (700 for the first 30 days), per its plans page": "Kostenloser Tarif „Intro“: bis zu 40 Personen (700 in den ersten 30 Tagen), laut Tarifseite", "Team quiz scoring rewards accuracy, not just table size": "Teamwertung belohnt Genauigkeit, nicht nur die Teamgröße", "Score averages per player, so a bigger team doesn't automatically win": "Die Punkte sind ein Durchschnitt pro Person, ein größeres Team gewinnt also nicht automatisch", "Scoring mechanics for their team competitions aren't publicly documented": "Die Wertungsregeln ihrer Teamwettbewerbe sind nicht öffentlich dokumentiert", "One method, every deck": "Eine Methode, jedes Deck", "Paste a QR box onto any slide in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF and present as normal — no add-in to install, and nothing to rebuild if you switch tools later.": "Füge einen QR-Block auf eine beliebige Folie in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides oder einem PDF ein und präsentiere wie gewohnt – kein Add-in zu installieren und nichts neu zu bauen, wenn du später das Programm wechselst.", "AI that reads your material": "KI, die dein Material liest", "Polly drafts questions from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or your own notes — and turns open-text answers into themes and sentiment as they come in.": "Polly entwirft Fragen aus einem Thema, einem hochgeladenen PDF oder deinen Notizen – und macht aus offenen Antworten Themen und Stimmung, während sie eintreffen.", "One suite, one plan": "Eine Suite, ein Tarif", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions.": "Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze und Lernsets in einem Tarif, mit einem kostenlosen Tarif für echte Sitzungen.", "Free — up to 40 people per poll": "Kostenlos – bis zu 40 Personen pro Umfrage", "Present — $10/month, or $120 billed annually": "Present – 10 $/Monat oder 120 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung", "Engage and Teams plans, priced per organisation": "Tarife Engage und Teams, Preis pro Organisation", "🤝 When Poll Everywhere might be the better fit": "🤝 Wann Poll Everywhere besser passen könnte", "Poll Everywhere has been refining live classroom and meeting polling since 2007, and it shows: campuses standardized on Canvas get native gradebook and roster integration that PollSlide doesn't offer, and SMS text-in voting is a genuine fallback for audiences without reliable phone data or the ability to install anything. If that institutional depth — or a text-in option — is what you need, Poll Everywhere is worth a look. PollSlide is the better fit when you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study in one plan, AI that works from your own material, and nothing to rebuild when you switch presentation tools.": "Poll Everywhere verfeinert Live-Umfragen für Unterricht und Meetings seit 2007, und das merkt man: Hochschulen mit Canvas bekommen eine native Notenbuch- und Teilnehmerlisten-Integration, die PollSlide nicht bietet, und die SMS-Abstimmung ist ein echter Ausweg für Publikum ohne verlässliche mobile Daten oder ohne Möglichkeit, etwas zu installieren. Wenn du diese institutionelle Tiefe – oder SMS-Abstimmung – brauchst, lohnt sich ein Blick auf Poll Everywhere. PollSlide passt besser, wenn du Umfragen, Quizze, Befragungen und Lernen in einem Tarif willst, KI, die mit deinem eigenen Material arbeitet, und nichts neu bauen willst, wenn du das Präsentationsprogramm wechselst.", "Is PollSlide a good Poll Everywhere alternative?": "Ist PollSlide eine gute Alternative zu Poll Everywhere?", "Yes, if you want polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan, plus AI that turns open answers into themes. Poll Everywhere is a long-established choice with SMS text-in voting and deep LMS integration, which PollSlide does not offer.": "Ja, wenn du Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze und Lernsets in einem Tarif willst, dazu KI, die offene Antworten zu Themen bündelt. Poll Everywhere ist eine etablierte Wahl mit SMS-Abstimmung und tiefer LMS-Integration, die PollSlide nicht bietet.", "Does Poll Everywhere work inside PowerPoint and Keynote?": "Funktioniert Poll Everywhere in PowerPoint und Keynote?", "Yes. Poll Everywhere lists PowerPoint integration on all its plans and offers a presenter add-in for PowerPoint and Keynote on Mac. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF with a QR on the slide; its PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft.": "Ja. Poll Everywhere führt die PowerPoint-Integration in allen Tarifen auf und bietet ein Add-in für PowerPoint und Keynote auf dem Mac. PollSlide funktioniert über Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides oder einem PDF mit einem QR-Code auf der Folie; sein PowerPoint-Add-in wird von Microsoft geprüft.", "How do PollSlide and Poll Everywhere prices compare?": "Wie unterscheiden sich die Preise von PollSlide und Poll Everywhere?", "PollSlide has a free plan for 25 participants per session and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually). Poll Everywhere's free plan allows up to 40 people, and its Present plan is $10 a month or $120 billed annually, priced per organisation. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide hat einen kostenlosen Tarif für 25 Teilnehmende pro Sitzung und Pro für 12 $ im Monat (10 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung). Der kostenlose Tarif von Poll Everywhere erlaubt bis zu 40 Personen, und der Tarif Present kostet 10 $ im Monat oder 120 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung, Preis pro Organisation. Geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Poll Everywhere and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Vergleich auf Basis öffentlich verfügbarer Informationen, geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026. Funktionen und Preise der Mitbewerber ändern sich oft – bitte auf deren Website prüfen. Poll Everywhere und andere Namen sind Marken ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber; diese Seite wird von ihnen weder unterstützt noch steht sie mit ihnen in Verbindung.", "PollSlide vs AhaSlides — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs. AhaSlides – der ehrliche Vergleich", "vs AhaSlides": "vs. AhaSlides", "AhaSlides packs polls, quizzes, word clouds, brainstorm boards and more into its own online editor, with real AI question generation built in. PollSlide takes a different bet: your own Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or PDF stays exactly as you built it, with a QR on the slide as the one method that works on every surface — Keynote included.": "AhaSlides bündelt Umfragen, Quizze, Wortwolken, Brainstorming-Boards und mehr in einem eigenen Online-Editor, mit echter KI-Fragengenerierung. PollSlide setzt auf etwas anderes: Dein eigenes Keynote-, PowerPoint-, Google-Slides- oder PDF-Deck bleibt genau so, wie du es gebaut hast, mit einem QR-Code auf der Folie als der einen Methode, die überall funktioniert – Keynote inklusive.", "AhaSlides is a genuinely broad, easy-to-use interaction platform — if you're happy building or importing your content into its own editor. PollSlide is built around the opposite bet: you keep presenting your original deck, unchanged, from any app including Keynote, while Polly AI drafts the questions and a QR on the slide is the one method that works everywhere without an install.": "AhaSlides ist eine wirklich breite, leicht bedienbare Interaktionsplattform – wenn du deine Inhalte gern in ihrem eigenen Editor erstellst oder importierst. PollSlide setzt auf das Gegenteil: Du präsentierst dein Original-Deck unverändert aus jeder App, auch Keynote, während Polly AI die Fragen entwirft und ein QR-Code auf der Folie die eine Methode ist, die überall ohne Installation funktioniert.", "Presents from your existing Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF, unmodified": "Präsentiert aus deinem vorhandenen Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF, unverändert", "Imports convert slides to static images inside AhaSlides' own editor": "Importe wandeln Folien im eigenen Editor von AhaSlides in statische Bilder um", "Works with Keynote at all": "Funktioniert überhaupt mit Keynote", "QR-on-slide works everywhere; free Mac companion floats results on top": "Der QR-Code auf der Folie funktioniert überall; die kostenlose Mac-Begleit-App blendet Ergebnisse darüber ein", "No Keynote add-in — an open, undated request on AhaSlides' own forum": "Kein Keynote-Add-in – ein offener, undatierter Wunsch im eigenen Forum von AhaSlides", "Library of interaction types (word clouds, brainstorm boards, spinner wheel, rating scales)": "Bibliothek an Interaktionstypen (Wortwolken, Brainstorming-Boards, Glücksrad, Bewertungsskalen)", "From a topic, notes, or a PDF": "Aus einem Thema, Notizen oder einem PDF", "From an uploaded PDF, PPT, Word or Excel file": "Aus einer hochgeladenen PDF-, PPT-, Word- oder Excel-Datei", "Free tier that runs a full, real session": "Kostenloser Tarif für eine vollständige, echte Sitzung", "25 participants, 5 Polly AI generations/month, no card": "25 Teilnehmende, 5 Polly-AI-Generierungen pro Monat, ohne Karte", "50 participants, but capped at 5 quiz + 3 poll questions per presentation": "50 Teilnehmende, aber maximal 5 Quiz- + 3 Umfragefragen pro Präsentation", "Imports keep your animations, embedded audio/video and links": "Importe behalten Animationen, eingebettetes Audio/Video und Links", "Nothing to import — you present the original file": "Nichts zu importieren – du präsentierst die Originaldatei", "Import strips animations, audio/video and links (50MB / 100-slide limit)": "Der Import entfernt Animationen, Audio/Video und Links (Limit 50 MB / 100 Folien)", "Tiered per-plan pricing; verify current terms on their site": "Gestaffelte Preise je Tarif; aktuelle Bedingungen auf deren Website prüfen", "Keep your slides, exactly as built": "Behalte deine Folien genau so, wie du sie gebaut hast", "PollSlide floats a QR over the deck you already made — Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, a PDF. Nothing gets rebuilt or converted into static images inside someone else's editor.": "PollSlide legt einen QR-Code über das Deck, das du schon gebaut hast – Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, ein PDF. Nichts wird nachgebaut oder im Editor eines anderen in statische Bilder umgewandelt.", "Actually works on Keynote": "Funktioniert wirklich mit Keynote", "Keynote has no public plugin ecosystem, so the QR-on-slide method plus a free Mac companion app is the real, shipped answer — not an open feature request.": "Keynote hat kein öffentliches Plug-in-System, daher sind der QR-Code auf der Folie und eine kostenlose Mac-Begleit-App die echte, verfügbare Lösung – kein offener Funktionswunsch.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions — not a handful of questions to test the water.": "Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze und Lernsets in einem Tarif, mit einem kostenlosen Tarif für echte Sitzungen – nicht nur eine Handvoll Fragen zum Ausprobieren.", "Free — 50 participants, a few quiz and poll questions per presentation": "Kostenlos – 50 Teilnehmende, einige Quiz- und Umfragefragen pro Präsentation", "Paid plans billed monthly or yearly — see ahaslides.com/pricing": "Bezahlte Tarife, monatlich oder jährlich – siehe ahaslides.com/pricing", "Team plans with volume discounts": "Team-Tarife mit Mengenrabatt", "🤝 When AhaSlides might be the better fit": "🤝 Wann AhaSlides besser passen könnte", "If you want the widest single toolbox of interaction types — word clouds, brainstorm boards, a spinner wheel, rating scales — built and templated inside one polished editor, AhaSlides already ships all of that, and its AI question generator and PowerPoint add-in are live today, not in review. PollSlide is the better fit when presenting your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — matters more to you than that breadth of interaction types.": "Wenn du den größten Werkzeugkasten an Interaktionstypen willst – Wortwolken, Brainstorming-Boards, Glücksrad, Bewertungsskalen – in einem ausgereiften Editor mit Vorlagen, liefert AhaSlides all das schon, und sein KI-Fragengenerator und sein PowerPoint-Add-in sind heute verfügbar, nicht in Prüfung. PollSlide passt besser, wenn dir wichtiger ist, dein eigenes Deck genau so zu präsentieren, wie du es gebaut hast – Keynote inklusive –, als diese Vielfalt an Interaktionen.", "Is PollSlide a good AhaSlides alternative?": "Ist PollSlide eine gute Alternative zu AhaSlides?", "Yes, if you want to present your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — with live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top. AhaSlides has a wider toolbox of interaction types inside its own editor, and a PowerPoint add-in available today.": "Ja, wenn du dein eigenes Deck genau so präsentieren willst, wie du es gebaut hast – Keynote inklusive –, mit Live-Umfragen, Quizzen, Befragungen und Publikumsfragen obendrauf. AhaSlides hat in seinem eigenen Editor mehr Interaktionstypen und ein PowerPoint-Add-in, das heute verfügbar ist.", "Does AhaSlides work with PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "Funktioniert AhaSlides mit PowerPoint und Google Slides?", "Yes. According to its pricing page you can import PowerPoint slides into AhaSlides or add AhaSlides to a PowerPoint presentation with its add-in, and it integrates with Google Slides. Keynote is not mentioned. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF.": "Ja. Laut Preisseite kannst du PowerPoint-Folien in AhaSlides importieren oder AhaSlides per Add-in in eine PowerPoint-Präsentation einfügen, und es lässt sich mit Google Slides verbinden. Keynote wird nicht erwähnt. PollSlide funktioniert über Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides oder einem PDF.", "How do PollSlide and AhaSlides prices compare?": "Wie unterscheiden sich die Preise von PollSlide und AhaSlides?", "Both have a free plan: PollSlide's runs real sessions for 25 participants, AhaSlides' allows 50 participants with a few quiz and poll questions per presentation. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); check ahaslides.com/pricing for its current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Beide haben einen kostenlosen Tarif: Der von PollSlide erlaubt echte Sitzungen mit 25 Teilnehmenden, der von AhaSlides 50 Teilnehmende mit einigen Quiz- und Umfragefragen pro Präsentation. PollSlide Pro kostet 12 $ im Monat (10 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung); aktuelle Preise von AhaSlides unter ahaslides.com/pricing. Geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. AhaSlides and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Vergleich auf Basis öffentlich verfügbarer Informationen, geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026. Funktionen und Preise der Mitbewerber ändern sich oft – bitte auf deren Website prüfen. AhaSlides und andere Namen sind Marken ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber; diese Seite wird von ihnen weder unterstützt noch steht sie mit ihnen in Verbindung.", "PollSlide vs Wooclap — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs. Wooclap – der ehrliche Vergleich", "vs Wooclap": "vs. Wooclap", "Wooclap packs in 20+ question types and deep LMS/SSO integrations — but it asks you to build your session in its own editor, or let its add-in insert its own slides into PowerPoint or Google Slides. PollSlide asks for none of that: paste a QR box on the slide you already made, in any app, and results appear on top.": "Wooclap bietet über 20 Fragetypen und tiefe LMS/SSO-Integrationen – verlangt aber, dass du deine Sitzung in seinem eigenen Editor baust oder sein Add-in eigene Folien in PowerPoint oder Google Slides einfügen lässt. PollSlide verlangt nichts davon: Füge einen QR-Block auf der Folie ein, die du schon gemacht hast, in jeder App, und die Ergebnisse erscheinen darüber.", "Wooclap is a mature, feature-rich platform for building a session inside its own event editor — or inserting its interactive slides into PowerPoint (native add-in) or Google Slides (browser extension) — with a big question-type library and real LMS/SSO wiring for schools and enterprise. PollSlide takes the opposite approach: your existing Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides or PDF deck never gets touched or converted — a QR box you paste onto any slide is the whole integration, and one free Mac companion floats results over whatever app you're already presenting from.": "Wooclap ist eine ausgereifte, funktionsreiche Plattform, um eine Sitzung in seinem eigenen Event-Editor zu bauen – oder seine interaktiven Folien in PowerPoint (natives Add-in) oder Google Slides (Browsererweiterung) einzufügen –, mit großer Fragetyp-Bibliothek und echter LMS/SSO-Anbindung für Schulen und Unternehmen. PollSlide geht den umgekehrten Weg: Dein vorhandenes Keynote-, PowerPoint-, Slides- oder PDF-Deck wird nie angefasst oder umgewandelt – ein QR-Block auf einer beliebigen Folie ist die ganze Integration, und eine kostenlose Mac-Begleit-App blendet die Ergebnisse über der App ein, aus der du ohnehin präsentierst.", "Your original deck stays completely untouched": "Dein Original-Deck bleibt völlig unberührt", "No import, no conversion, no inserted slides": "Kein Import, keine Umwandlung, keine eingefügten Folien", "PowerPoint/Slides work by inserting Wooclap's own slides into your deck": "In PowerPoint/Slides werden Wooclaps eigene Folien in dein Deck eingefügt", "Keynote keeps its native animations, video & links": "Keynote behält seine nativen Animationen, Videos und Links", "Your Keynote file is never converted": "Deine Keynote-Datei wird nie umgewandelt", "Wooclap's own docs group Keynote with PDF uploads — converted to static images, losing animations, hyperlinks and video": "Wooclaps eigene Doku ordnet Keynote den PDF-Uploads zu – umgewandelt in statische Bilder, ohne Animationen, Links und Video", "Background companion overlays results on any app": "Eine Begleit-App im Hintergrund blendet Ergebnisse über jeder App ein", "Free Mac menu-bar app floats results over Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF automatically": "Eine kostenlose Mac-Menüleisten-App blendet Ergebnisse automatisch über Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF ein", "Live results only appear inside Wooclap's web player, PowerPoint pane, or its own inserted slides": "Live-Ergebnisse erscheinen nur im Web-Player von Wooclap, im PowerPoint-Bereich oder auf seinen eingefügten Folien", "Native PowerPoint add-in": "Natives PowerPoint-Add-in", "A native Office add-in is in review with Microsoft, not yet published": "Ein natives Office-Add-in wird von Microsoft geprüft, noch nicht veröffentlicht", "Established add-in, in use today": "Etabliertes Add-in, heute im Einsatz", "LMS sync & SSO/SAML for institutions": "LMS-Synchronisierung & SSO/SAML für Institutionen", "Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard sync, SSO/SAML/CAS on enterprise tiers": "Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard-Synchronisierung, SSO/SAML/CAS in den Enterprise-Stufen", "No install or account needed for your audience": "Dein Publikum braucht keine Installation und kein Konto", "AI drafts questions from your content": "KI entwirft Fragen aus deinen Inhalten", "From a topic, a PDF, or your own notes — plus matching images": "Aus einem Thema, einem PDF oder deinen Notizen – samt passenden Bildern", "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard generates from an uploaded document, PDF, audio/video or URL": "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard erstellt aus einem hochgeladenen Dokument, PDF, Audio/Video oder einer URL", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study — one flat plan": "Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze und Lernen – ein Pauschaltarif", "One platform, but export, unlimited questions, AI and branding are split across Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate tiers": "Eine Plattform, aber Export, unbegrenzte Fragen, KI und Branding verteilen sich auf die Stufen Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate", "Free tier with no rolling question cap": "Kostenloser Tarif ohne laufendes Fragenlimit", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, no credit card": "3 gespeicherte Decks, 25 Teilnehmende pro Sitzung, ohne Kreditkarte", "Free Starter caps active questions at 5 per rolling 30-day period, and doesn't allow exporting results": "Der kostenlose Starter-Tarif begrenzt aktive Fragen auf 5 pro 30 Tage und erlaubt keinen Export der Ergebnisse", "Breadth of built-in question-type formats": "Vielfalt eingebauter Fragetyp-Formate", "Covers the core interactive types": "Deckt die wichtigsten interaktiven Typen ab", "20+ formats — word cloud, ranking, matching, brainstorming, spin-the-wheel and more": "Über 20 Formate – Wortwolke, Rangfolge, Zuordnung, Brainstorming, Glücksrad und mehr", "Your deck stays exactly as you built it": "Dein Deck bleibt genau so, wie du es gebaut hast", "No exporting into Wooclap's editor, no letting an add-in insert someone else's slides, no Keynote file getting flattened into static images. Paste a QR box on the slide you already made and present like you always do.": "Kein Export in den Editor von Wooclap, kein Add-in, das fremde Folien einfügt, keine Keynote-Datei, die zu statischen Bildern platt gemacht wird. Füge einen QR-Block auf der Folie ein, die du schon gemacht hast, und präsentiere wie immer.", "One companion, not an add-in per app": "Eine Begleit-App, nicht ein Add-in pro Programm", "The free Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF automatically — no add-in pane to manage, no browser extension, no separate web player to babysit.": "Die kostenlose Mac-Begleit-App blendet Live-Ergebnisse automatisch über Keynote, PowerPoint oder einem PDF ein – kein Add-in-Bereich zu verwalten, keine Browsererweiterung, kein separater Web-Player zum Aufpassen.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes, study — one price": "Umfragen, Befragungen, Quizze, Lernen – ein Preis", "Everything runs on a single flat plan with a free tier that runs real sessions, not a Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate ladder where exporting and AI sit behind higher tiers.": "Alles läuft mit einem einzigen Pauschaltarif und einem kostenlosen Tarif für echte Sitzungen – keine Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate-Treppe, bei der Export und KI in höheren Stufen stecken.", "Free Starter plan — 5 questions a month": "Kostenloser Starter-Tarif – 5 Fragen pro Monat", "Basic and Pro plans, billed annually — see wooclap.com/pricing": "Tarife Basic und Pro, jährliche Abrechnung – siehe wooclap.com/pricing", "Corporate from 6 presenters": "Corporate ab 6 Vortragenden", "Campus and corporate — custom": "Campus und Unternehmen – individuell", "🤝 When Wooclap might be the better fit": "🤝 Wann Wooclap besser passen könnte", "Wooclap's library of 20+ interactive question types — word clouds, ranking, matching, brainstorming boards, spin-the-wheel and more — goes well beyond a typical live-polling tool, and its LMS sync (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) plus SSO/SAML/CAS make it a genuinely strong fit for IT-managed school or enterprise rollouts. If that specific breadth or institutional wiring is what you need, Wooclap is worth a look.": "Wooclaps Bibliothek mit über 20 interaktiven Fragetypen – Wortwolken, Rangfolgen, Zuordnungen, Brainstorming-Boards, Glücksrad und mehr – geht weit über ein typisches Live-Umfrage-Tool hinaus, und die LMS-Synchronisierung (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) samt SSO/SAML/CAS macht es zu einer starken Wahl für IT-verwaltete Einführungen an Schulen oder in Unternehmen. Wenn du genau diese Vielfalt oder Anbindung brauchst, lohnt sich ein Blick auf Wooclap.", "Is PollSlide a good Wooclap alternative?": "Ist PollSlide eine gute Alternative zu Wooclap?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study sets in one flat plan over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. Wooclap has a broad library of question types and LMS sync with SSO, which suits IT-managed school and enterprise rollouts.": "Ja, wenn du Umfragen, Quizze, Befragungen und Lernsets in einem Pauschaltarif über deinem eigenen Keynote-, PowerPoint- oder Google-Slides-Deck willst. Wooclap hat eine breite Bibliothek an Fragetypen und LMS-Synchronisierung mit SSO, was zu IT-verwalteten Einführungen an Schulen und in Unternehmen passt.", "Does Wooclap work inside PowerPoint?": "Funktioniert Wooclap in PowerPoint?", "Yes. Wooclap says it works with PowerPoint, Google Slides and Microsoft Teams. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote, and the Mac companion floats live results over any deck.": "Ja. Laut Wooclap funktioniert es mit PowerPoint, Google Slides und Microsoft Teams. Das PowerPoint-Add-in von PollSlide wird von Microsoft geprüft; der QR-Code auf der Folie funktioniert schon heute in PowerPoint, Google Slides und Keynote, und die Mac-Begleit-App blendet Live-Ergebnisse über jedem Deck ein.", "How do PollSlide and Wooclap prices compare?": "Wie unterscheiden sich die Preise von PollSlide und Wooclap?", "Both have a free plan. Wooclap's Starter plan allows 5 questions a month; PollSlide's free plan runs full sessions for 25 participants. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); Wooclap's paid plans are billed annually — check wooclap.com/pricing. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Beide haben einen kostenlosen Tarif. Wooclaps Starter-Tarif erlaubt 5 Fragen pro Monat; der kostenlose Tarif von PollSlide erlaubt vollständige Sitzungen mit 25 Teilnehmenden. PollSlide Pro kostet 12 $ im Monat (10 $ bei jährlicher Abrechnung); die bezahlten Tarife von Wooclap werden jährlich abgerechnet – siehe wooclap.com/pricing. Geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Wooclap's features and pricing change often — please verify current details on their site. Wooclap and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Vergleich auf Basis öffentlich verfügbarer Informationen, geprüft am 7. Oktober 2026. Funktionen und Preise von Wooclap ändern sich oft – bitte aktuelle Angaben auf deren Website prüfen. Wooclap und andere Namen sind Marken ihrer jeweiligen Inhaber; diese Seite wird von ihnen weder unterstützt noch steht sie mit ihnen in Verbindung."}, "fr": {"Free plan available": "Offre gratuite disponible", "Paid one-time and annual plans — see slido.com/pricing": "Offres payantes ponctuelles et annuelles — voir slido.com/pricing", "Annual and enterprise plans": "Offres annuelles et entreprise", "Prices in US dollars where shown, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Prix en dollars américains lorsqu’ils sont indiqués, vérifiés le 7 octobre 2026 sur la page tarifs de chaque entreprise. Ils changent — vérifie-les sur", "and the other company's before you decide.": "et celle de l’autre entreprise avant de décider.", "Is PollSlide a good Slido alternative?": "PollSlide est-il une bonne alternative à Slido ?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A in one plan over the slides you already have. Slido is strongest for moderated Q&A in large meetings, especially in Webex. PollSlide adds graded quizzes with game modes, surveys and study sets, and works over Keynote as well as PowerPoint and Google Slides.": "Oui, si tu veux sondages, quiz, enquêtes et questions du public dans une seule offre, par-dessus les diapos que tu as déjà. Slido excelle dans les questions modérées des grandes réunions, surtout dans Webex. PollSlide ajoute des quiz notés avec modes de jeu, des enquêtes et des sets de révision, et fonctionne avec Keynote comme avec PowerPoint et Google Slides.", "Does Slido work inside PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "Slido fonctionne-t-il dans PowerPoint et Google Slides ?", "Yes. Slido offers a PowerPoint add-in and a Google Slides add-on, according to its help community. Its Mac Switcher app, which other presentation tools relied on, was retired in January 2025. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote.": "Oui. D’après sa communauté d’aide, Slido propose un complément PowerPoint et un module Google Slides. Son appli Mac Switcher, sur laquelle s’appuyaient les autres logiciels de présentation, a été retirée en janvier 2025. Le complément PowerPoint de PollSlide est en cours de validation par Microsoft ; la méthode du QR sur la diapo fonctionne déjà dans PowerPoint, Google Slides et Keynote.", "How do PollSlide and Slido prices compare?": "Comment se comparent les prix de PollSlide et de Slido ?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Slido sells one-time and annual plans; check slido.com/pricing for current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide propose une offre gratuite et Pro à 12 $ par mois (10 $ en facturation annuelle), avec sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision. Slido vend des offres ponctuelles et annuelles ; consulte slido.com/pricing pour les prix actuels. Vérifié le 7 octobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Slido and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparatif fondé sur des informations publiques, vérifiées le 7 octobre 2026. Les fonctionnalités et les prix des concurrents changent souvent — vérifie-les sur leur site. Slido et les autres noms sont des marques de leurs propriétaires respectifs ; cette page n’est ni approuvée par eux ni affiliée à eux.", "Kahoot! 360 Pro plans from $19/month, billed annually": "Offres Kahoot! 360 Pro à partir de 19 $/mois, facturation annuelle", "Higher Pro tiers by participant count (up to 2,000+)": "Niveaux Pro supérieurs selon le nombre de participants (jusqu’à 2 000 et plus)", "Is PollSlide a good Kahoot alternative?": "PollSlide est-il une bonne alternative à Kahoot ?", "Yes, if you need more than a game-show quiz. PollSlide runs quizzes with game modes alongside real polls, open feedback, surveys and study sets, over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. For a pure high-energy quiz game, especially with younger students, Kahoot is purpose-built.": "Oui, si tu veux plus qu’un quiz façon émission de télé. PollSlide mêle quiz aux modes ludiques, vrais sondages, retours libres, enquêtes et sets de révision, par-dessus ta propre présentation Keynote, PowerPoint ou Google Slides. Pour un pur quiz plein d’énergie, surtout avec de jeunes élèves, Kahoot est conçu pour ça.", "Can Kahoot use my existing slides?": "Kahoot peut-il utiliser mes diapos existantes ?", "Kahoot! 360 can import PowerPoint, Keynote and PDF files, and its Pro Standard plan and above sync with PowerPoint and Google Slides, according to its pricing page. PollSlide works over the original deck itself: paste a QR on any slide, and the Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF.": "D’après sa page tarifs, Kahoot! 360 peut importer des fichiers PowerPoint, Keynote et PDF, et à partir de l’offre Pro Standard il se synchronise avec PowerPoint et Google Slides. PollSlide fonctionne par-dessus la présentation d’origine : colle un QR sur n’importe quelle diapo, et l’appli compagnon Mac affiche les résultats en direct sur Keynote, PowerPoint ou un PDF.", "How do PollSlide and Kahoot prices compare?": "Comment se comparent les prix de PollSlide et de Kahoot ?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Kahoot! 360 Pro plans start at $19 a month billed annually, with higher tiers for more participants. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide propose une offre gratuite et Pro à 12 $ par mois (10 $ en facturation annuelle), avec sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision. Les offres Kahoot! 360 Pro commencent à 19 $ par mois en facturation annuelle, avec des niveaux supérieurs pour plus de participants. Prix vérifiés le 7 octobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Kahoot and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparatif fondé sur des informations publiques, vérifiées le 7 octobre 2026. Les fonctionnalités et les prix des concurrents changent souvent — vérifie-les sur leur site. Kahoot et les autres noms sont des marques de leurs propriétaires respectifs ; cette page n’est ni approuvée par eux ni affiliée à eux.", "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere — le comparatif honnête", "vs Poll Everywhere": "vs Poll Everywhere", "Poll Everywhere has run live classroom and meeting polls since 2007, with deep Canvas gradebook integration and SMS voting built in. PollSlide takes a different route: one QR you paste onto any slide, in any tool, plus AI that drafts from your own material and a full quiz-and-study suite in one plan.": "Poll Everywhere anime des sondages en direct en classe et en réunion depuis 2007, avec une intégration poussée au carnet de notes de Canvas et le vote par SMS. PollSlide prend un autre chemin : un QR que tu colles sur n’importe quelle diapo, dans n’importe quel outil, une IA qui rédige à partir de ton propre contenu, et une suite complète de quiz et de révision dans une seule offre.", "Poll Everywhere is a mature, institutional tool — its Canvas gradebook integration and SMS text-in fallback are genuinely hard to match, especially for large campus lecture classes. PollSlide is built for presenters who don't want to insert activity slides into their deck at all: paste one QR box onto any existing slide, run polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets from a single plan, and let Polly AI draft from a PDF or your own notes instead of just a typed topic.": "Poll Everywhere est un outil mûr et institutionnel — son intégration au carnet de notes de Canvas et le vote par SMS sont difficiles à égaler, surtout pour les grands amphis. PollSlide est conçu pour les présentateurs qui ne veulent pas du tout insérer de diapos d’activité dans leur présentation : colle un bloc QR sur n’importe quelle diapo existante, lance sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision avec une seule offre, et laisse Polly AI rédiger à partir d’un PDF ou de tes notes plutôt que d’un simple sujet.", "Works the same way on Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF — one method": "Fonctionne de la même façon sur Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou un PDF — une seule méthode", "Copy a QR box onto any slide in any tool; nothing to rebuild": "Copie un bloc QR sur n’importe quelle diapo, dans n’importe quel outil ; rien à refaire", "Separate native integrations per app; importing a deck into a different tool can break already-embedded activities": "Des intégrations natives distinctes par appli ; importer une présentation dans un autre outil peut casser les activités déjà intégrées", "Native add-in already published for your slide app": "Complément natif déjà publié pour ton appli de présentation", "PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; Google Slides integration is planned, not shipped": "Le complément PowerPoint est en cours de validation par Microsoft ; l’intégration Google Slides est prévue, pas encore livrée", "Native PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) and Google Slides integrations, plus a Live App overlay for other software": "Intégrations natives PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) et Google Slides, plus une superposition Live App pour les autres logiciels", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets — one product": "Sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision — un seul produit", "Built around live, synchronous activities; no documented async study/review mode": "Conçu pour des activités en direct et synchrones ; pas de mode de révision asynchrone documenté", "AI drafts questions from your own PDF or notes": "L’IA rédige des questions à partir de ton propre PDF ou de tes notes", "Polly AI works from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or pasted notes": "Polly AI travaille à partir d’un sujet, d’un PDF importé ou de notes collées", "Generates multiple-choice questions from a typed topic; no documented ability to read an uploaded deck or PDF": "Génère des QCM à partir d’un sujet tapé ; aucune capacité documentée à lire une présentation ou un PDF importé", "AI turns open-text answers into themes + sentiment": "L’IA transforme les réponses libres en thèmes + sentiment", "SMS text-in voting (no app, no data plan needed)": "Vote par SMS (sans appli ni forfait data)", "A real advantage for audiences with limited phone data or no ability to install anything": "Un vrai avantage pour les publics qui ont peu de data ou ne peuvent rien installer", "Native LMS gradebook integration (e.g. Canvas)": "Intégration native au carnet de notes du LMS (ex. Canvas)", "Deep higher-ed install base, with roster import for attendance": "Forte présence dans le supérieur, avec import de listes pour la présence", "Free companion app floats results over your presentation automatically": "L’appli compagnon gratuite affiche automatiquement les résultats par-dessus ta présentation", "macOS only today; the QR-on-slide method itself needs zero install on any OS": "Uniquement macOS pour l’instant ; la méthode du QR sur la diapo ne demande aucune installation, quel que soit le système", "A Live App overlay covers other software; the deepest experience is inside their own native add-ins": "Une superposition Live App couvre les autres logiciels ; l’expérience la plus complète se trouve dans leurs propres compléments natifs", "Free tier for real sessions": "Offre gratuite pour de vraies sessions", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, 5 Polly generations/month — no card required": "3 présentations enregistrées, 25 participants par session, 5 générations Polly par mois — sans carte", "Free \"Intro\" plan: up to 40 people (700 for the first 30 days), per its plans page": "Offre gratuite « Intro » : jusqu’à 40 personnes (700 les 30 premiers jours), d’après sa page des offres", "Team quiz scoring rewards accuracy, not just table size": "Le score d’équipe récompense la justesse, pas seulement la taille de l’équipe", "Score averages per player, so a bigger team doesn't automatically win": "Le score est une moyenne par joueur : une équipe plus nombreuse ne gagne pas automatiquement", "Scoring mechanics for their team competitions aren't publicly documented": "Les règles de score de leurs compétitions en équipe ne sont pas documentées publiquement", "One method, every deck": "Une méthode, toutes les présentations", "Paste a QR box onto any slide in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF and present as normal — no add-in to install, and nothing to rebuild if you switch tools later.": "Colle un bloc QR sur n’importe quelle diapo dans Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou un PDF et présente comme d’habitude — aucun complément à installer, et rien à refaire si tu changes d’outil plus tard.", "AI that reads your material": "Une IA qui lit ton contenu", "Polly drafts questions from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or your own notes — and turns open-text answers into themes and sentiment as they come in.": "Polly rédige des questions à partir d’un sujet, d’un PDF importé ou de tes notes — et transforme les réponses libres en thèmes et en sentiment au fil de l’eau.", "One suite, one plan": "Une suite, une offre", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions.": "Sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision dans une seule offre, avec une offre gratuite qui permet de vraies sessions.", "Free — up to 40 people per poll": "Gratuit — jusqu’à 40 personnes par sondage", "Present — $10/month, or $120 billed annually": "Present — 10 $/mois, ou 120 $ en facturation annuelle", "Engage and Teams plans, priced per organisation": "Offres Engage et Teams, tarifées par organisation", "🤝 When Poll Everywhere might be the better fit": "🤝 Quand Poll Everywhere peut mieux convenir", "Poll Everywhere has been refining live classroom and meeting polling since 2007, and it shows: campuses standardized on Canvas get native gradebook and roster integration that PollSlide doesn't offer, and SMS text-in voting is a genuine fallback for audiences without reliable phone data or the ability to install anything. If that institutional depth — or a text-in option — is what you need, Poll Everywhere is worth a look. PollSlide is the better fit when you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study in one plan, AI that works from your own material, and nothing to rebuild when you switch presentation tools.": "Poll Everywhere peaufine les sondages en direct pour la classe et les réunions depuis 2007, et ça se voit : les campus équipés de Canvas profitent d’une intégration native au carnet de notes et aux listes que PollSlide ne propose pas, et le vote par SMS est une vraie solution de repli pour les publics sans data fiable ou qui ne peuvent rien installer. Si c’est cette profondeur institutionnelle — ou le vote par SMS — qu’il te faut, Poll Everywhere mérite le détour. PollSlide convient mieux si tu veux sondages, quiz, enquêtes et révision dans une seule offre, une IA qui part de ton propre contenu, et rien à refaire quand tu changes d’outil de présentation.", "Is PollSlide a good Poll Everywhere alternative?": "PollSlide est-il une bonne alternative à Poll Everywhere ?", "Yes, if you want polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan, plus AI that turns open answers into themes. Poll Everywhere is a long-established choice with SMS text-in voting and deep LMS integration, which PollSlide does not offer.": "Oui, si tu veux sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision dans une seule offre, plus une IA qui transforme les réponses libres en thèmes. Poll Everywhere est un choix de longue date, avec vote par SMS et intégration LMS poussée, que PollSlide ne propose pas.", "Does Poll Everywhere work inside PowerPoint and Keynote?": "Poll Everywhere fonctionne-t-il dans PowerPoint et Keynote ?", "Yes. Poll Everywhere lists PowerPoint integration on all its plans and offers a presenter add-in for PowerPoint and Keynote on Mac. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF with a QR on the slide; its PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft.": "Oui. Poll Everywhere inclut l’intégration PowerPoint dans toutes ses offres et propose un complément pour PowerPoint et Keynote sur Mac. PollSlide fonctionne par-dessus Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou un PDF avec un QR sur la diapo ; son complément PowerPoint est en cours de validation par Microsoft.", "How do PollSlide and Poll Everywhere prices compare?": "Comment se comparent les prix de PollSlide et de Poll Everywhere ?", "PollSlide has a free plan for 25 participants per session and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually). Poll Everywhere's free plan allows up to 40 people, and its Present plan is $10 a month or $120 billed annually, priced per organisation. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide propose une offre gratuite pour 25 participants par session et Pro à 12 $ par mois (10 $ en facturation annuelle). L’offre gratuite de Poll Everywhere accepte jusqu’à 40 personnes, et son offre Present coûte 10 $ par mois ou 120 $ en facturation annuelle, tarifée par organisation. Vérifié le 7 octobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Poll Everywhere and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparatif fondé sur des informations publiques, vérifiées le 7 octobre 2026. Les fonctionnalités et les prix des concurrents changent souvent — vérifie-les sur leur site. Poll Everywhere et les autres noms sont des marques de leurs propriétaires respectifs ; cette page n’est ni approuvée par eux ni affiliée à eux.", "PollSlide vs AhaSlides — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs AhaSlides — le comparatif honnête", "vs AhaSlides": "vs AhaSlides", "AhaSlides packs polls, quizzes, word clouds, brainstorm boards and more into its own online editor, with real AI question generation built in. PollSlide takes a different bet: your own Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or PDF stays exactly as you built it, with a QR on the slide as the one method that works on every surface — Keynote included.": "AhaSlides réunit sondages, quiz, nuages de mots, tableaux d’idées et plus dans son propre éditeur en ligne, avec une vraie génération de questions par IA. PollSlide fait un autre pari : ton Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou PDF reste exactement tel que tu l’as conçu, avec un QR sur la diapo comme seule méthode qui marche partout — Keynote compris.", "AhaSlides is a genuinely broad, easy-to-use interaction platform — if you're happy building or importing your content into its own editor. PollSlide is built around the opposite bet: you keep presenting your original deck, unchanged, from any app including Keynote, while Polly AI drafts the questions and a QR on the slide is the one method that works everywhere without an install.": "AhaSlides est une plateforme d’interaction vraiment complète et simple — si tu acceptes de créer ou d’importer ton contenu dans son propre éditeur. PollSlide fait le pari inverse : tu continues à présenter ta présentation d’origine, sans changement, depuis n’importe quelle appli, Keynote compris, pendant que Polly AI rédige les questions et qu’un QR sur la diapo reste la seule méthode qui marche partout sans installation.", "Presents from your existing Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF, unmodified": "Présente depuis ton Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF existant, sans modification", "Imports convert slides to static images inside AhaSlides' own editor": "Les imports convertissent les diapos en images fixes dans l’éditeur d’AhaSlides", "Works with Keynote at all": "Fonctionne avec Keynote", "QR-on-slide works everywhere; free Mac companion floats results on top": "Le QR sur la diapo marche partout ; l’appli compagnon Mac gratuite affiche les résultats par-dessus", "No Keynote add-in — an open, undated request on AhaSlides' own forum": "Pas de complément Keynote — une demande ouverte et sans date sur le forum d’AhaSlides", "Library of interaction types (word clouds, brainstorm boards, spinner wheel, rating scales)": "Bibliothèque de types d’interaction (nuages de mots, tableaux d’idées, roue, échelles de notation)", "From a topic, notes, or a PDF": "À partir d’un sujet, de notes ou d’un PDF", "From an uploaded PDF, PPT, Word or Excel file": "À partir d’un fichier PDF, PPT, Word ou Excel importé", "Free tier that runs a full, real session": "Offre gratuite qui permet une vraie session complète", "25 participants, 5 Polly AI generations/month, no card": "25 participants, 5 générations Polly AI par mois, sans carte", "50 participants, but capped at 5 quiz + 3 poll questions per presentation": "50 participants, mais limité à 5 questions de quiz + 3 de sondage par présentation", "Imports keep your animations, embedded audio/video and links": "Les imports conservent tes animations, l’audio/vidéo intégré et les liens", "Nothing to import — you present the original file": "Rien à importer — tu présentes le fichier d’origine", "Import strips animations, audio/video and links (50MB / 100-slide limit)": "L’import supprime animations, audio/vidéo et liens (limite de 50 Mo / 100 diapos)", "Tiered per-plan pricing; verify current terms on their site": "Tarifs par paliers selon l’offre ; vérifie les conditions actuelles sur leur site", "Keep your slides, exactly as built": "Garde tes diapos exactement telles quelles", "PollSlide floats a QR over the deck you already made — Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, a PDF. Nothing gets rebuilt or converted into static images inside someone else's editor.": "PollSlide place un QR par-dessus la présentation que tu as déjà faite — Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, un PDF. Rien n’est refait ni converti en images fixes dans l’éditeur de quelqu’un d’autre.", "Actually works on Keynote": "Fonctionne vraiment avec Keynote", "Keynote has no public plugin ecosystem, so the QR-on-slide method plus a free Mac companion app is the real, shipped answer — not an open feature request.": "Keynote n’a pas d’écosystème public de modules, donc la méthode du QR sur la diapo et une appli compagnon Mac gratuite sont la vraie réponse, déjà disponible — pas une demande en attente.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions — not a handful of questions to test the water.": "Sondages, enquêtes, quiz et sets de révision dans une seule offre, avec une offre gratuite qui permet de vraies sessions — pas une poignée de questions pour tâter le terrain.", "Free — 50 participants, a few quiz and poll questions per presentation": "Gratuit — 50 participants, quelques questions de quiz et de sondage par présentation", "Paid plans billed monthly or yearly — see ahaslides.com/pricing": "Offres payantes mensuelles ou annuelles — voir ahaslides.com/pricing", "Team plans with volume discounts": "Offres d’équipe avec remises sur volume", "🤝 When AhaSlides might be the better fit": "🤝 Quand AhaSlides peut mieux convenir", "If you want the widest single toolbox of interaction types — word clouds, brainstorm boards, a spinner wheel, rating scales — built and templated inside one polished editor, AhaSlides already ships all of that, and its AI question generator and PowerPoint add-in are live today, not in review. PollSlide is the better fit when presenting your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — matters more to you than that breadth of interaction types.": "Si tu veux la boîte à outils la plus large en types d’interaction — nuages de mots, tableaux d’idées, roue, échelles de notation — dans un éditeur soigné avec modèles, AhaSlides propose déjà tout cela, et son générateur de questions par IA et son complément PowerPoint sont disponibles aujourd’hui, pas en validation. PollSlide convient mieux si présenter ta propre présentation telle que tu l’as conçue — Keynote compris — compte plus pour toi que cette variété d’interactions.", "Is PollSlide a good AhaSlides alternative?": "PollSlide est-il une bonne alternative à AhaSlides ?", "Yes, if you want to present your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — with live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top. AhaSlides has a wider toolbox of interaction types inside its own editor, and a PowerPoint add-in available today.": "Oui, si tu veux présenter ta propre présentation telle que tu l’as conçue — Keynote compris — avec sondages en direct, quiz, enquêtes et questions du public par-dessus. AhaSlides offre plus de types d’interaction dans son propre éditeur, et un complément PowerPoint disponible aujourd’hui.", "Does AhaSlides work with PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "AhaSlides fonctionne-t-il avec PowerPoint et Google Slides ?", "Yes. According to its pricing page you can import PowerPoint slides into AhaSlides or add AhaSlides to a PowerPoint presentation with its add-in, and it integrates with Google Slides. Keynote is not mentioned. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF.": "Oui. D’après sa page tarifs, tu peux importer des diapos PowerPoint dans AhaSlides ou ajouter AhaSlides à une présentation PowerPoint avec son complément, et il s’intègre à Google Slides. Keynote n’est pas mentionné. PollSlide fonctionne par-dessus Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou un PDF.", "How do PollSlide and AhaSlides prices compare?": "Comment se comparent les prix de PollSlide et d’AhaSlides ?", "Both have a free plan: PollSlide's runs real sessions for 25 participants, AhaSlides' allows 50 participants with a few quiz and poll questions per presentation. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); check ahaslides.com/pricing for its current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Les deux ont une offre gratuite : celle de PollSlide permet de vraies sessions pour 25 participants, celle d’AhaSlides accepte 50 participants avec quelques questions de quiz et de sondage par présentation. PollSlide Pro coûte 12 $ par mois (10 $ en facturation annuelle) ; consulte ahaslides.com/pricing pour leurs prix actuels. Vérifié le 7 octobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. AhaSlides and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparatif fondé sur des informations publiques, vérifiées le 7 octobre 2026. Les fonctionnalités et les prix des concurrents changent souvent — vérifie-les sur leur site. AhaSlides et les autres noms sont des marques de leurs propriétaires respectifs ; cette page n’est ni approuvée par eux ni affiliée à eux.", "PollSlide vs Wooclap — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs Wooclap — le comparatif honnête", "vs Wooclap": "vs Wooclap", "Wooclap packs in 20+ question types and deep LMS/SSO integrations — but it asks you to build your session in its own editor, or let its add-in insert its own slides into PowerPoint or Google Slides. PollSlide asks for none of that: paste a QR box on the slide you already made, in any app, and results appear on top.": "Wooclap réunit plus de 20 types de questions et des intégrations LMS/SSO poussées — mais il te demande de créer ta session dans son propre éditeur, ou de laisser son complément insérer ses propres diapos dans PowerPoint ou Google Slides. PollSlide ne te demande rien de tout ça : colle un bloc QR sur la diapo que tu as déjà faite, dans n’importe quelle appli, et les résultats s’affichent par-dessus.", "Wooclap is a mature, feature-rich platform for building a session inside its own event editor — or inserting its interactive slides into PowerPoint (native add-in) or Google Slides (browser extension) — with a big question-type library and real LMS/SSO wiring for schools and enterprise. PollSlide takes the opposite approach: your existing Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides or PDF deck never gets touched or converted — a QR box you paste onto any slide is the whole integration, and one free Mac companion floats results over whatever app you're already presenting from.": "Wooclap est une plateforme mûre et riche en fonctionnalités pour construire une session dans son propre éditeur d’événements — ou insérer ses diapos interactives dans PowerPoint (complément natif) ou Google Slides (extension de navigateur) — avec une grande bibliothèque de types de questions et une vraie connexion LMS/SSO pour les écoles et les entreprises. PollSlide fait l’inverse : ta présentation Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides ou PDF n’est jamais touchée ni convertie — un bloc QR collé sur n’importe quelle diapo, c’est toute l’intégration, et une appli compagnon Mac gratuite affiche les résultats par-dessus l’appli depuis laquelle tu présentes déjà.", "Your original deck stays completely untouched": "Ta présentation d’origine reste totalement intacte", "No import, no conversion, no inserted slides": "Pas d’import, pas de conversion, pas de diapos insérées", "PowerPoint/Slides work by inserting Wooclap's own slides into your deck": "Dans PowerPoint/Slides, cela passe par l’insertion des diapos de Wooclap dans ta présentation", "Keynote keeps its native animations, video & links": "Keynote garde ses animations, vidéos et liens natifs", "Your Keynote file is never converted": "Ton fichier Keynote n’est jamais converti", "Wooclap's own docs group Keynote with PDF uploads — converted to static images, losing animations, hyperlinks and video": "La documentation de Wooclap range Keynote avec les imports PDF — converti en images fixes, sans animations, liens ni vidéo", "Background companion overlays results on any app": "Une appli compagnon en arrière-plan affiche les résultats par-dessus n’importe quelle appli", "Free Mac menu-bar app floats results over Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF automatically": "Une appli gratuite dans la barre des menus du Mac affiche automatiquement les résultats sur Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF", "Live results only appear inside Wooclap's web player, PowerPoint pane, or its own inserted slides": "Les résultats en direct n’apparaissent que dans le lecteur web de Wooclap, son volet PowerPoint ou ses propres diapos insérées", "Native PowerPoint add-in": "Complément PowerPoint natif", "A native Office add-in is in review with Microsoft, not yet published": "Un complément Office natif est en cours de validation par Microsoft, pas encore publié", "Established add-in, in use today": "Complément établi, utilisé aujourd’hui", "LMS sync & SSO/SAML for institutions": "Synchronisation LMS et SSO/SAML pour les établissements", "Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard sync, SSO/SAML/CAS on enterprise tiers": "Synchronisation Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard, SSO/SAML/CAS sur les offres entreprise", "No install or account needed for your audience": "Ton public n’a rien à installer ni de compte à créer", "AI drafts questions from your content": "L’IA rédige des questions à partir de ton contenu", "From a topic, a PDF, or your own notes — plus matching images": "À partir d’un sujet, d’un PDF ou de tes notes — avec des images assorties", "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard generates from an uploaded document, PDF, audio/video or URL": "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard génère à partir d’un document, d’un PDF, d’un audio/vidéo ou d’une URL", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study — one flat plan": "Sondages, enquêtes, quiz et révision — une seule offre", "One platform, but export, unlimited questions, AI and branding are split across Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate tiers": "Une plateforme, mais l’export, les questions illimitées, l’IA et la personnalisation sont répartis entre les offres Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate", "Free tier with no rolling question cap": "Offre gratuite sans plafond de questions glissant", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, no credit card": "3 présentations enregistrées, 25 participants par session, sans carte bancaire", "Free Starter caps active questions at 5 per rolling 30-day period, and doesn't allow exporting results": "L’offre gratuite Starter limite les questions actives à 5 par période glissante de 30 jours et ne permet pas d’exporter les résultats", "Breadth of built-in question-type formats": "Variété des formats de question intégrés", "Covers the core interactive types": "Couvre les types interactifs essentiels", "20+ formats — word cloud, ranking, matching, brainstorming, spin-the-wheel and more": "Plus de 20 formats — nuage de mots, classement, association, remue-méninges, roue et plus", "Your deck stays exactly as you built it": "Ta présentation reste exactement telle que tu l’as conçue", "No exporting into Wooclap's editor, no letting an add-in insert someone else's slides, no Keynote file getting flattened into static images. Paste a QR box on the slide you already made and present like you always do.": "Pas d’export dans l’éditeur de Wooclap, pas de complément qui insère les diapos de quelqu’un d’autre, pas de fichier Keynote aplati en images fixes. Colle un bloc QR sur la diapo que tu as déjà faite et présente comme d’habitude.", "One companion, not an add-in per app": "Une appli compagnon, pas un complément par appli", "The free Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF automatically — no add-in pane to manage, no browser extension, no separate web player to babysit.": "L’appli compagnon Mac gratuite affiche automatiquement les résultats en direct sur Keynote, PowerPoint ou un PDF — pas de volet de complément à gérer, pas d’extension de navigateur, pas de lecteur web à surveiller.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes, study — one price": "Sondages, enquêtes, quiz, révision — un seul prix", "Everything runs on a single flat plan with a free tier that runs real sessions, not a Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate ladder where exporting and AI sit behind higher tiers.": "Tout fonctionne avec une seule offre, et une offre gratuite qui permet de vraies sessions — pas une échelle Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate où l’export et l’IA sont réservés aux offres supérieures.", "Free Starter plan — 5 questions a month": "Offre gratuite Starter — 5 questions par mois", "Basic and Pro plans, billed annually — see wooclap.com/pricing": "Offres Basic et Pro en facturation annuelle — voir wooclap.com/pricing", "Corporate from 6 presenters": "Corporate à partir de 6 présentateurs", "Campus and corporate — custom": "Campus et entreprise — sur mesure", "🤝 When Wooclap might be the better fit": "🤝 Quand Wooclap peut mieux convenir", "Wooclap's library of 20+ interactive question types — word clouds, ranking, matching, brainstorming boards, spin-the-wheel and more — goes well beyond a typical live-polling tool, and its LMS sync (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) plus SSO/SAML/CAS make it a genuinely strong fit for IT-managed school or enterprise rollouts. If that specific breadth or institutional wiring is what you need, Wooclap is worth a look.": "La bibliothèque de plus de 20 types de questions interactives de Wooclap — nuages de mots, classements, associations, tableaux d’idées, roue et plus — va bien au-delà d’un outil de sondage classique, et sa synchronisation LMS (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) avec SSO/SAML/CAS en fait un très bon choix pour les déploiements gérés par l’informatique dans les écoles ou les entreprises. Si c’est cette variété ou cette intégration institutionnelle qu’il te faut, Wooclap mérite le détour.", "Is PollSlide a good Wooclap alternative?": "PollSlide est-il une bonne alternative à Wooclap ?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study sets in one flat plan over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. Wooclap has a broad library of question types and LMS sync with SSO, which suits IT-managed school and enterprise rollouts.": "Oui, si tu veux sondages, quiz, enquêtes et sets de révision dans une seule offre, par-dessus ta propre présentation Keynote, PowerPoint ou Google Slides. Wooclap propose une large bibliothèque de types de questions et une synchronisation LMS avec SSO, adaptées aux déploiements gérés par l’informatique dans les écoles et les entreprises.", "Does Wooclap work inside PowerPoint?": "Wooclap fonctionne-t-il dans PowerPoint ?", "Yes. Wooclap says it works with PowerPoint, Google Slides and Microsoft Teams. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote, and the Mac companion floats live results over any deck.": "Oui. Wooclap indique fonctionner avec PowerPoint, Google Slides et Microsoft Teams. Le complément PowerPoint de PollSlide est en cours de validation par Microsoft ; la méthode du QR sur la diapo fonctionne déjà dans PowerPoint, Google Slides et Keynote, et l’appli compagnon Mac affiche les résultats en direct par-dessus n’importe quelle présentation.", "How do PollSlide and Wooclap prices compare?": "Comment se comparent les prix de PollSlide et de Wooclap ?", "Both have a free plan. Wooclap's Starter plan allows 5 questions a month; PollSlide's free plan runs full sessions for 25 participants. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); Wooclap's paid plans are billed annually — check wooclap.com/pricing. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Les deux ont une offre gratuite. L’offre Starter de Wooclap permet 5 questions par mois ; l’offre gratuite de PollSlide permet des sessions complètes pour 25 participants. PollSlide Pro coûte 12 $ par mois (10 $ en facturation annuelle) ; les offres payantes de Wooclap sont facturées à l’année — voir wooclap.com/pricing. Vérifié le 7 octobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Wooclap's features and pricing change often — please verify current details on their site. Wooclap and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparatif fondé sur des informations publiques, vérifiées le 7 octobre 2026. Les fonctionnalités et les prix de Wooclap changent souvent — vérifie les informations actuelles sur leur site. Wooclap et les autres noms sont des marques de leurs propriétaires respectifs ; cette page n’est ni approuvée par eux ni affiliée à eux."}, "pt": {"Free plan available": "Plano gratuito disponível", "Paid one-time and annual plans — see slido.com/pricing": "Planos pagos pontuais e anuais — consulte slido.com/pricing", "Annual and enterprise plans": "Planos anuais e empresariais", "Prices in US dollars where shown, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Preços em dólares norte-americanos quando indicados, verificados a 7 de outubro de 2026 na página de preços de cada empresa. Mudam — confirme-os na", "and the other company's before you decide.": "e na da outra empresa antes de decidir.", "Is PollSlide a good Slido alternative?": "O PollSlide é uma boa alternativa ao Slido?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A in one plan over the slides you already have. Slido is strongest for moderated Q&A in large meetings, especially in Webex. PollSlide adds graded quizzes with game modes, surveys and study sets, and works over Keynote as well as PowerPoint and Google Slides.": "Sim, se quiser sondagens, quizzes, inquéritos e perguntas do público num só plano sobre os diapositivos que já tem. O Slido destaca-se nas perguntas moderadas de grandes reuniões, sobretudo no Webex. O PollSlide acrescenta quizzes avaliados com modos de jogo, inquéritos e conjuntos de estudo, e funciona sobre o Keynote além do PowerPoint e do Google Slides.", "Does Slido work inside PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "O Slido funciona dentro do PowerPoint e do Google Slides?", "Yes. Slido offers a PowerPoint add-in and a Google Slides add-on, according to its help community. Its Mac Switcher app, which other presentation tools relied on, was retired in January 2025. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote.": "Sim. Segundo a sua comunidade de ajuda, o Slido oferece um suplemento para PowerPoint e outro para Google Slides. A sua aplicação Switcher para Mac, de que dependiam outras ferramentas de apresentação, foi descontinuada em janeiro de 2025. O suplemento do PowerPoint do PollSlide está em análise pela Microsoft; o método do QR no diapositivo já funciona no PowerPoint, Google Slides e Keynote.", "How do PollSlide and Slido prices compare?": "Como se comparam os preços do PollSlide e do Slido?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Slido sells one-time and annual plans; check slido.com/pricing for current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "O PollSlide tem um plano gratuito e o Pro a 12 $ por mês (10 $ com faturação anual), com sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo. O Slido vende planos pontuais e anuais; consulte slido.com/pricing para os preços atuais. Verificado a 7 de outubro de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Slido and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparação baseada em informação pública, verificada a 7 de outubro de 2026. As funcionalidades e os preços da concorrência mudam com frequência — confirme no site deles. Slido e outros nomes são marcas dos respetivos titulares; esta página não é aprovada por eles nem está afiliada a eles.", "Kahoot! 360 Pro plans from $19/month, billed annually": "Planos Kahoot! 360 Pro a partir de 19 $/mês, faturação anual", "Higher Pro tiers by participant count (up to 2,000+)": "Níveis Pro superiores conforme o número de participantes (até mais de 2000)", "Is PollSlide a good Kahoot alternative?": "O PollSlide é uma boa alternativa ao Kahoot?", "Yes, if you need more than a game-show quiz. PollSlide runs quizzes with game modes alongside real polls, open feedback, surveys and study sets, over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. For a pure high-energy quiz game, especially with younger students, Kahoot is purpose-built.": "Sim, se precisar de mais do que um concurso. O PollSlide junta quizzes com modos de jogo a verdadeiras sondagens, comentários abertos, inquéritos e conjuntos de estudo, sobre a sua própria apresentação do Keynote, PowerPoint ou Google Slides. Para um puro jogo de quiz cheio de energia, sobretudo com alunos mais novos, o Kahoot foi feito para isso.", "Can Kahoot use my existing slides?": "O Kahoot pode usar os meus diapositivos atuais?", "Kahoot! 360 can import PowerPoint, Keynote and PDF files, and its Pro Standard plan and above sync with PowerPoint and Google Slides, according to its pricing page. PollSlide works over the original deck itself: paste a QR on any slide, and the Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF.": "Segundo a sua página de preços, o Kahoot! 360 pode importar ficheiros do PowerPoint, Keynote e PDF, e a partir do plano Pro Standard sincroniza com o PowerPoint e o Google Slides. O PollSlide funciona sobre a própria apresentação original: cole um QR em qualquer diapositivo e a aplicação complementar para Mac mostra os resultados em direto sobre o Keynote, PowerPoint ou um PDF.", "How do PollSlide and Kahoot prices compare?": "Como se comparam os preços do PollSlide e do Kahoot?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Kahoot! 360 Pro plans start at $19 a month billed annually, with higher tiers for more participants. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "O PollSlide tem um plano gratuito e o Pro a 12 $ por mês (10 $ com faturação anual), com sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo. Os planos Kahoot! 360 Pro começam nos 19 $ por mês com faturação anual, com níveis superiores para mais participantes. Preços verificados a 7 de outubro de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Kahoot and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparação baseada em informação pública, verificada a 7 de outubro de 2026. As funcionalidades e os preços da concorrência mudam com frequência — confirme no site deles. Kahoot e outros nomes são marcas dos respetivos titulares; esta página não é aprovada por eles nem está afiliada a eles.", "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere — a comparação honesta", "vs Poll Everywhere": "vs Poll Everywhere", "Poll Everywhere has run live classroom and meeting polls since 2007, with deep Canvas gradebook integration and SMS voting built in. PollSlide takes a different route: one QR you paste onto any slide, in any tool, plus AI that drafts from your own material and a full quiz-and-study suite in one plan.": "O Poll Everywhere faz sondagens em direto em aulas e reuniões desde 2007, com uma integração profunda com a pauta do Canvas e votação por SMS. O PollSlide segue outro caminho: um QR que cola em qualquer diapositivo, em qualquer ferramenta, mais uma IA que redige a partir do seu próprio material e um conjunto completo de quizzes e estudo num só plano.", "Poll Everywhere is a mature, institutional tool — its Canvas gradebook integration and SMS text-in fallback are genuinely hard to match, especially for large campus lecture classes. PollSlide is built for presenters who don't want to insert activity slides into their deck at all: paste one QR box onto any existing slide, run polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets from a single plan, and let Polly AI draft from a PDF or your own notes instead of just a typed topic.": "O Poll Everywhere é uma ferramenta madura e institucional — a integração com a pauta do Canvas e a votação por SMS são difíceis de igualar, sobretudo em grandes aulas universitárias. O PollSlide foi feito para quem não quer inserir diapositivos de atividades na apresentação: cole um bloco QR em qualquer diapositivo existente, faça sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo com um só plano e deixe a Polly AI redigir a partir de um PDF ou das suas notas, não apenas de um tema escrito.", "Works the same way on Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF — one method": "Funciona da mesma forma no Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou num PDF — um só método", "Copy a QR box onto any slide in any tool; nothing to rebuild": "Copie um bloco QR para qualquer diapositivo em qualquer ferramenta; nada para refazer", "Separate native integrations per app; importing a deck into a different tool can break already-embedded activities": "Integrações nativas separadas por aplicação; importar uma apresentação para outra ferramenta pode estragar as atividades já incorporadas", "Native add-in already published for your slide app": "Suplemento nativo já publicado para a sua aplicação de apresentações", "PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; Google Slides integration is planned, not shipped": "O suplemento do PowerPoint está em análise pela Microsoft; a integração com o Google Slides está prevista, ainda não disponível", "Native PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) and Google Slides integrations, plus a Live App overlay for other software": "Integrações nativas com PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) e Google Slides, mais uma sobreposição Live App para outros programas", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets — one product": "Sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo — um só produto", "Built around live, synchronous activities; no documented async study/review mode": "Pensado para atividades em direto e síncronas; sem modo de estudo ou revisão assíncrono documentado", "AI drafts questions from your own PDF or notes": "A IA redige perguntas a partir do seu próprio PDF ou notas", "Polly AI works from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or pasted notes": "A Polly AI trabalha a partir de um tema, de um PDF carregado ou de notas coladas", "Generates multiple-choice questions from a typed topic; no documented ability to read an uploaded deck or PDF": "Gera perguntas de escolha múltipla a partir de um tema escrito; sem capacidade documentada de ler uma apresentação ou PDF carregado", "AI turns open-text answers into themes + sentiment": "A IA transforma respostas abertas em temas + sentimento", "SMS text-in voting (no app, no data plan needed)": "Votação por SMS (sem aplicação nem dados móveis)", "A real advantage for audiences with limited phone data or no ability to install anything": "Uma vantagem real para públicos com poucos dados móveis ou sem possibilidade de instalar nada", "Native LMS gradebook integration (e.g. Canvas)": "Integração nativa com a pauta do LMS (ex.: Canvas)", "Deep higher-ed install base, with roster import for attendance": "Grande presença no ensino superior, com importação de listas para as presenças", "Free companion app floats results over your presentation automatically": "A aplicação complementar gratuita mostra os resultados sobre a apresentação automaticamente", "macOS only today; the QR-on-slide method itself needs zero install on any OS": "Por agora só macOS; o método do QR no diapositivo não exige instalação em nenhum sistema", "A Live App overlay covers other software; the deepest experience is inside their own native add-ins": "Uma sobreposição Live App cobre outros programas; a experiência mais completa está nos seus próprios suplementos nativos", "Free tier for real sessions": "Plano gratuito para sessões reais", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, 5 Polly generations/month — no card required": "3 apresentações guardadas, 25 participantes por sessão, 5 gerações da Polly por mês — sem cartão", "Free \"Intro\" plan: up to 40 people (700 for the first 30 days), per its plans page": "Plano gratuito «Intro»: até 40 pessoas (700 nos primeiros 30 dias), segundo a sua página de planos", "Team quiz scoring rewards accuracy, not just table size": "A pontuação por equipas premeia a precisão, não só o tamanho da equipa", "Score averages per player, so a bigger team doesn't automatically win": "A pontuação é a média por jogador, por isso uma equipa maior não ganha automaticamente", "Scoring mechanics for their team competitions aren't publicly documented": "As regras de pontuação das suas competições por equipas não estão documentadas publicamente", "One method, every deck": "Um método, qualquer apresentação", "Paste a QR box onto any slide in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF and present as normal — no add-in to install, and nothing to rebuild if you switch tools later.": "Cole um bloco QR em qualquer diapositivo do Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou num PDF e apresente como sempre — sem suplementos para instalar e nada para refazer se mudar de ferramenta mais tarde.", "AI that reads your material": "IA que lê o seu material", "Polly drafts questions from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or your own notes — and turns open-text answers into themes and sentiment as they come in.": "A Polly redige perguntas a partir de um tema, de um PDF carregado ou das suas notas — e transforma as respostas abertas em temas e sentimento à medida que chegam.", "One suite, one plan": "Uma suite, um plano", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions.": "Sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo num só plano, com um plano gratuito que permite sessões reais.", "Free — up to 40 people per poll": "Gratuito — até 40 pessoas por sondagem", "Present — $10/month, or $120 billed annually": "Present — 10 $/mês, ou 120 $ com faturação anual", "Engage and Teams plans, priced per organisation": "Planos Engage e Teams, com preço por organização", "🤝 When Poll Everywhere might be the better fit": "🤝 Quando o Poll Everywhere pode ser a melhor opção", "Poll Everywhere has been refining live classroom and meeting polling since 2007, and it shows: campuses standardized on Canvas get native gradebook and roster integration that PollSlide doesn't offer, and SMS text-in voting is a genuine fallback for audiences without reliable phone data or the ability to install anything. If that institutional depth — or a text-in option — is what you need, Poll Everywhere is worth a look. PollSlide is the better fit when you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study in one plan, AI that works from your own material, and nothing to rebuild when you switch presentation tools.": "O Poll Everywhere aperfeiçoa as sondagens em direto para aulas e reuniões desde 2007, e nota-se: os campus que usam o Canvas têm uma integração nativa com a pauta e as listas que o PollSlide não oferece, e a votação por SMS é uma verdadeira alternativa para públicos sem dados fiáveis ou sem possibilidade de instalar nada. Se precisa dessa profundidade institucional — ou de votação por SMS —, vale a pena olhar para o Poll Everywhere. O PollSlide encaixa melhor quando quer sondagens, quizzes, inquéritos e estudo num só plano, uma IA que trabalha com o seu próprio material e nada para refazer ao mudar de ferramenta de apresentação.", "Is PollSlide a good Poll Everywhere alternative?": "O PollSlide é uma boa alternativa ao Poll Everywhere?", "Yes, if you want polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan, plus AI that turns open answers into themes. Poll Everywhere is a long-established choice with SMS text-in voting and deep LMS integration, which PollSlide does not offer.": "Sim, se quiser sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo num só plano, além de uma IA que transforma as respostas abertas em temas. O Poll Everywhere é uma escolha estabelecida, com votação por SMS e integração profunda com LMS, que o PollSlide não oferece.", "Does Poll Everywhere work inside PowerPoint and Keynote?": "O Poll Everywhere funciona dentro do PowerPoint e do Keynote?", "Yes. Poll Everywhere lists PowerPoint integration on all its plans and offers a presenter add-in for PowerPoint and Keynote on Mac. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF with a QR on the slide; its PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft.": "Sim. O Poll Everywhere inclui integração com o PowerPoint em todos os planos e oferece um suplemento para PowerPoint e Keynote no Mac. O PollSlide funciona sobre o Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou um PDF com um QR no diapositivo; o seu suplemento do PowerPoint está em análise pela Microsoft.", "How do PollSlide and Poll Everywhere prices compare?": "Como se comparam os preços do PollSlide e do Poll Everywhere?", "PollSlide has a free plan for 25 participants per session and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually). Poll Everywhere's free plan allows up to 40 people, and its Present plan is $10 a month or $120 billed annually, priced per organisation. Checked 7 October 2026.": "O PollSlide tem um plano gratuito para 25 participantes por sessão e o Pro a 12 $ por mês (10 $ com faturação anual). O plano gratuito do Poll Everywhere permite até 40 pessoas e o plano Present custa 10 $ por mês ou 120 $ com faturação anual, com preço por organização. Verificado a 7 de outubro de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Poll Everywhere and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparação baseada em informação pública, verificada a 7 de outubro de 2026. As funcionalidades e os preços da concorrência mudam com frequência — confirme no site deles. Poll Everywhere e outros nomes são marcas dos respetivos titulares; esta página não é aprovada por eles nem está afiliada a eles.", "PollSlide vs AhaSlides — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs AhaSlides — a comparação honesta", "vs AhaSlides": "vs AhaSlides", "AhaSlides packs polls, quizzes, word clouds, brainstorm boards and more into its own online editor, with real AI question generation built in. PollSlide takes a different bet: your own Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or PDF stays exactly as you built it, with a QR on the slide as the one method that works on every surface — Keynote included.": "O AhaSlides junta sondagens, quizzes, nuvens de palavras, quadros de ideias e mais no seu próprio editor online, com geração de perguntas por IA integrada. O PollSlide aposta noutra coisa: o seu Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou PDF fica exatamente como o criou, com um QR no diapositivo como o único método que funciona em todo o lado — Keynote incluído.", "AhaSlides is a genuinely broad, easy-to-use interaction platform — if you're happy building or importing your content into its own editor. PollSlide is built around the opposite bet: you keep presenting your original deck, unchanged, from any app including Keynote, while Polly AI drafts the questions and a QR on the slide is the one method that works everywhere without an install.": "O AhaSlides é uma plataforma de interação realmente ampla e fácil de usar — se não se importar de criar ou importar o seu conteúdo no editor deles. O PollSlide aposta no contrário: continua a apresentar a sua apresentação original, sem alterações, em qualquer aplicação, incluindo o Keynote, enquanto a Polly AI redige as perguntas e um QR no diapositivo é o único método que funciona em todo o lado sem instalar nada.", "Presents from your existing Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF, unmodified": "Apresenta a partir do seu Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF atual, sem alterações", "Imports convert slides to static images inside AhaSlides' own editor": "As importações convertem os diapositivos em imagens estáticas dentro do editor do AhaSlides", "Works with Keynote at all": "Funciona com o Keynote", "QR-on-slide works everywhere; free Mac companion floats results on top": "O QR no diapositivo funciona em todo o lado; a aplicação complementar gratuita para Mac mostra os resultados por cima", "No Keynote add-in — an open, undated request on AhaSlides' own forum": "Sem suplemento para Keynote — um pedido em aberto e sem data no próprio fórum do AhaSlides", "Library of interaction types (word clouds, brainstorm boards, spinner wheel, rating scales)": "Biblioteca de tipos de interação (nuvens de palavras, quadros de ideias, roda, escalas de classificação)", "From a topic, notes, or a PDF": "A partir de um tema, notas ou um PDF", "From an uploaded PDF, PPT, Word or Excel file": "A partir de um ficheiro PDF, PPT, Word ou Excel carregado", "Free tier that runs a full, real session": "Plano gratuito que permite uma sessão real completa", "25 participants, 5 Polly AI generations/month, no card": "25 participantes, 5 gerações da Polly AI por mês, sem cartão", "50 participants, but capped at 5 quiz + 3 poll questions per presentation": "50 participantes, mas limitado a 5 perguntas de quiz + 3 de sondagem por apresentação", "Imports keep your animations, embedded audio/video and links": "As importações mantêm as animações, o áudio/vídeo incorporado e as ligações", "Nothing to import — you present the original file": "Nada para importar — apresenta o ficheiro original", "Import strips animations, audio/video and links (50MB / 100-slide limit)": "A importação remove animações, áudio/vídeo e ligações (limite de 50 MB / 100 diapositivos)", "Tiered per-plan pricing; verify current terms on their site": "Preços por níveis consoante o plano; confirme as condições atuais no site deles", "Keep your slides, exactly as built": "Mantenha os seus diapositivos tal como os criou", "PollSlide floats a QR over the deck you already made — Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, a PDF. Nothing gets rebuilt or converted into static images inside someone else's editor.": "O PollSlide coloca um QR sobre a apresentação que já criou — Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, um PDF. Nada é refeito nem convertido em imagens estáticas no editor de outra pessoa.", "Actually works on Keynote": "Funciona mesmo no Keynote", "Keynote has no public plugin ecosystem, so the QR-on-slide method plus a free Mac companion app is the real, shipped answer — not an open feature request.": "O Keynote não tem um ecossistema público de extensões, por isso o método do QR no diapositivo e uma aplicação complementar gratuita para Mac são a resposta real e disponível — não um pedido pendente.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions — not a handful of questions to test the water.": "Sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e conjuntos de estudo num só plano, com um plano gratuito que permite sessões reais — não um punhado de perguntas para experimentar.", "Free — 50 participants, a few quiz and poll questions per presentation": "Gratuito — 50 participantes, algumas perguntas de quiz e sondagem por apresentação", "Paid plans billed monthly or yearly — see ahaslides.com/pricing": "Planos pagos com faturação mensal ou anual — consulte ahaslides.com/pricing", "Team plans with volume discounts": "Planos de equipa com descontos por volume", "🤝 When AhaSlides might be the better fit": "🤝 Quando o AhaSlides pode ser a melhor opção", "If you want the widest single toolbox of interaction types — word clouds, brainstorm boards, a spinner wheel, rating scales — built and templated inside one polished editor, AhaSlides already ships all of that, and its AI question generator and PowerPoint add-in are live today, not in review. PollSlide is the better fit when presenting your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — matters more to you than that breadth of interaction types.": "Se quiser a caixa de ferramentas mais ampla de tipos de interação — nuvens de palavras, quadros de ideias, roda, escalas de classificação — num editor cuidado e com modelos, o AhaSlides já oferece tudo isso, e o seu gerador de perguntas com IA e o suplemento do PowerPoint já estão disponíveis, não em análise. O PollSlide encaixa melhor quando apresentar a sua própria apresentação tal como a criou — Keynote incluído — conta mais do que essa variedade de interações.", "Is PollSlide a good AhaSlides alternative?": "O PollSlide é uma boa alternativa ao AhaSlides?", "Yes, if you want to present your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — with live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top. AhaSlides has a wider toolbox of interaction types inside its own editor, and a PowerPoint add-in available today.": "Sim, se quiser apresentar a sua própria apresentação tal como a criou — Keynote incluído — com sondagens em direto, quizzes, inquéritos e perguntas do público por cima. O AhaSlides tem mais tipos de interação no seu próprio editor e um suplemento do PowerPoint já disponível.", "Does AhaSlides work with PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "O AhaSlides funciona com o PowerPoint e o Google Slides?", "Yes. According to its pricing page you can import PowerPoint slides into AhaSlides or add AhaSlides to a PowerPoint presentation with its add-in, and it integrates with Google Slides. Keynote is not mentioned. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF.": "Sim. Segundo a sua página de preços, pode importar diapositivos do PowerPoint para o AhaSlides ou adicionar o AhaSlides a uma apresentação do PowerPoint com o suplemento, e integra-se com o Google Slides. O Keynote não é mencionado. O PollSlide funciona sobre o Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides ou um PDF.", "How do PollSlide and AhaSlides prices compare?": "Como se comparam os preços do PollSlide e do AhaSlides?", "Both have a free plan: PollSlide's runs real sessions for 25 participants, AhaSlides' allows 50 participants with a few quiz and poll questions per presentation. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); check ahaslides.com/pricing for its current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Ambos têm um plano gratuito: o do PollSlide permite sessões reais com 25 participantes e o do AhaSlides permite 50 participantes com algumas perguntas de quiz e sondagem por apresentação. O PollSlide Pro custa 12 $ por mês (10 $ com faturação anual); consulte ahaslides.com/pricing para os preços atuais. Verificado a 7 de outubro de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. AhaSlides and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparação baseada em informação pública, verificada a 7 de outubro de 2026. As funcionalidades e os preços da concorrência mudam com frequência — confirme no site deles. AhaSlides e outros nomes são marcas dos respetivos titulares; esta página não é aprovada por eles nem está afiliada a eles.", "PollSlide vs Wooclap — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs Wooclap — a comparação honesta", "vs Wooclap": "vs Wooclap", "Wooclap packs in 20+ question types and deep LMS/SSO integrations — but it asks you to build your session in its own editor, or let its add-in insert its own slides into PowerPoint or Google Slides. PollSlide asks for none of that: paste a QR box on the slide you already made, in any app, and results appear on top.": "O Wooclap junta mais de 20 tipos de perguntas e integrações profundas com LMS/SSO — mas pede-lhe que crie a sessão no seu próprio editor ou que deixe o suplemento inserir os seus próprios diapositivos no PowerPoint ou no Google Slides. O PollSlide não pede nada disso: cole um bloco QR no diapositivo que já criou, em qualquer aplicação, e os resultados aparecem por cima.", "Wooclap is a mature, feature-rich platform for building a session inside its own event editor — or inserting its interactive slides into PowerPoint (native add-in) or Google Slides (browser extension) — with a big question-type library and real LMS/SSO wiring for schools and enterprise. PollSlide takes the opposite approach: your existing Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides or PDF deck never gets touched or converted — a QR box you paste onto any slide is the whole integration, and one free Mac companion floats results over whatever app you're already presenting from.": "O Wooclap é uma plataforma madura e completa para criar uma sessão no seu próprio editor de eventos — ou inserir os seus diapositivos interativos no PowerPoint (suplemento nativo) ou no Google Slides (extensão do navegador) —, com uma grande biblioteca de tipos de perguntas e ligação real a LMS/SSO para escolas e empresas. O PollSlide faz o contrário: a sua apresentação do Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides ou PDF nunca é alterada nem convertida — um bloco QR colado em qualquer diapositivo é toda a integração, e uma aplicação complementar gratuita para Mac mostra os resultados sobre a aplicação a partir da qual já apresenta.", "Your original deck stays completely untouched": "A sua apresentação original fica completamente intacta", "No import, no conversion, no inserted slides": "Sem importação, sem conversão, sem diapositivos inseridos", "PowerPoint/Slides work by inserting Wooclap's own slides into your deck": "No PowerPoint/Slides funciona inserindo os próprios diapositivos do Wooclap na sua apresentação", "Keynote keeps its native animations, video & links": "O Keynote mantém as suas animações, vídeos e ligações nativos", "Your Keynote file is never converted": "O seu ficheiro do Keynote nunca é convertido", "Wooclap's own docs group Keynote with PDF uploads — converted to static images, losing animations, hyperlinks and video": "A própria documentação do Wooclap agrupa o Keynote com os carregamentos de PDF — convertido em imagens estáticas, perdendo animações, ligações e vídeo", "Background companion overlays results on any app": "Uma aplicação complementar em segundo plano mostra os resultados sobre qualquer aplicação", "Free Mac menu-bar app floats results over Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF automatically": "Uma aplicação gratuita na barra de menus do Mac mostra os resultados sobre o Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF automaticamente", "Live results only appear inside Wooclap's web player, PowerPoint pane, or its own inserted slides": "Os resultados em direto só aparecem no leitor web do Wooclap, no painel do PowerPoint ou nos seus próprios diapositivos inseridos", "Native PowerPoint add-in": "Suplemento nativo para PowerPoint", "A native Office add-in is in review with Microsoft, not yet published": "Um suplemento nativo do Office está em análise pela Microsoft, ainda não publicado", "Established add-in, in use today": "Suplemento estabelecido, em uso hoje", "LMS sync & SSO/SAML for institutions": "Sincronização com LMS e SSO/SAML para instituições", "Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard sync, SSO/SAML/CAS on enterprise tiers": "Sincronização com Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard, SSO/SAML/CAS nos níveis empresariais", "No install or account needed for your audience": "O seu público não precisa de instalar nada nem de conta", "AI drafts questions from your content": "A IA redige perguntas a partir do seu conteúdo", "From a topic, a PDF, or your own notes — plus matching images": "A partir de um tema, de um PDF ou das suas notas — com imagens a condizer", "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard generates from an uploaded document, PDF, audio/video or URL": "O Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard gera a partir de um documento, PDF, áudio/vídeo ou URL", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study — one flat plan": "Sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes e estudo — um só plano", "One platform, but export, unlimited questions, AI and branding are split across Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate tiers": "Uma plataforma, mas a exportação, as perguntas ilimitadas, a IA e a marca estão repartidas pelos níveis Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate", "Free tier with no rolling question cap": "Plano gratuito sem limite periódico de perguntas", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, no credit card": "3 apresentações guardadas, 25 participantes por sessão, sem cartão de crédito", "Free Starter caps active questions at 5 per rolling 30-day period, and doesn't allow exporting results": "O plano gratuito Starter limita as perguntas ativas a 5 por cada 30 dias e não permite exportar resultados", "Breadth of built-in question-type formats": "Variedade de formatos de pergunta integrados", "Covers the core interactive types": "Abrange os tipos interativos essenciais", "20+ formats — word cloud, ranking, matching, brainstorming, spin-the-wheel and more": "Mais de 20 formatos — nuvem de palavras, ordenação, correspondência, brainstorming, roda e mais", "Your deck stays exactly as you built it": "A sua apresentação fica exatamente como a criou", "No exporting into Wooclap's editor, no letting an add-in insert someone else's slides, no Keynote file getting flattened into static images. Paste a QR box on the slide you already made and present like you always do.": "Sem exportar para o editor do Wooclap, sem um suplemento a inserir diapositivos de outros, sem o seu ficheiro do Keynote reduzido a imagens estáticas. Cole um bloco QR no diapositivo que já criou e apresente como sempre.", "One companion, not an add-in per app": "Uma aplicação complementar, não um suplemento por aplicação", "The free Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF automatically — no add-in pane to manage, no browser extension, no separate web player to babysit.": "A aplicação complementar gratuita para Mac mostra os resultados em direto sobre o Keynote, PowerPoint ou um PDF automaticamente — sem painel de suplemento para gerir, sem extensão do navegador, sem um leitor web à parte para vigiar.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes, study — one price": "Sondagens, inquéritos, quizzes, estudo — um só preço", "Everything runs on a single flat plan with a free tier that runs real sessions, not a Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate ladder where exporting and AI sit behind higher tiers.": "Tudo funciona com um único plano e um plano gratuito que permite sessões reais — não uma escada Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate em que a exportação e a IA ficam nos níveis superiores.", "Free Starter plan — 5 questions a month": "Plano gratuito Starter — 5 perguntas por mês", "Basic and Pro plans, billed annually — see wooclap.com/pricing": "Planos Basic e Pro com faturação anual — consulte wooclap.com/pricing", "Corporate from 6 presenters": "Corporate a partir de 6 apresentadores", "Campus and corporate — custom": "Campus e empresas — personalizado", "🤝 When Wooclap might be the better fit": "🤝 Quando o Wooclap pode ser a melhor opção", "Wooclap's library of 20+ interactive question types — word clouds, ranking, matching, brainstorming boards, spin-the-wheel and more — goes well beyond a typical live-polling tool, and its LMS sync (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) plus SSO/SAML/CAS make it a genuinely strong fit for IT-managed school or enterprise rollouts. If that specific breadth or institutional wiring is what you need, Wooclap is worth a look.": "A biblioteca de mais de 20 tipos de perguntas interativas do Wooclap — nuvens de palavras, ordenação, correspondência, quadros de ideias, roda e mais — vai muito além de uma ferramenta de sondagens típica, e a sincronização com LMS (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) com SSO/SAML/CAS torna-o uma escolha forte para implementações geridas pela informática em escolas ou empresas. Se precisa dessa variedade ou dessa ligação institucional, vale a pena olhar para o Wooclap.", "Is PollSlide a good Wooclap alternative?": "O PollSlide é uma boa alternativa ao Wooclap?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study sets in one flat plan over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. Wooclap has a broad library of question types and LMS sync with SSO, which suits IT-managed school and enterprise rollouts.": "Sim, se quiser sondagens, quizzes, inquéritos e conjuntos de estudo num só plano sobre a sua própria apresentação do Keynote, PowerPoint ou Google Slides. O Wooclap tem uma ampla biblioteca de tipos de perguntas e sincronização com LMS e SSO, adequada a implementações geridas pela informática em escolas e empresas.", "Does Wooclap work inside PowerPoint?": "O Wooclap funciona dentro do PowerPoint?", "Yes. Wooclap says it works with PowerPoint, Google Slides and Microsoft Teams. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote, and the Mac companion floats live results over any deck.": "Sim. O Wooclap diz que funciona com o PowerPoint, o Google Slides e o Microsoft Teams. O suplemento do PowerPoint do PollSlide está em análise pela Microsoft; o método do QR no diapositivo já funciona no PowerPoint, Google Slides e Keynote, e a aplicação complementar para Mac mostra os resultados em direto sobre qualquer apresentação.", "How do PollSlide and Wooclap prices compare?": "Como se comparam os preços do PollSlide e do Wooclap?", "Both have a free plan. Wooclap's Starter plan allows 5 questions a month; PollSlide's free plan runs full sessions for 25 participants. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); Wooclap's paid plans are billed annually — check wooclap.com/pricing. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Ambos têm um plano gratuito. O plano Starter do Wooclap permite 5 perguntas por mês; o plano gratuito do PollSlide permite sessões completas com 25 participantes. O PollSlide Pro custa 12 $ por mês (10 $ com faturação anual); os planos pagos do Wooclap são faturados anualmente — consulte wooclap.com/pricing. Verificado a 7 de outubro de 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Wooclap's features and pricing change often — please verify current details on their site. Wooclap and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Comparação baseada em informação pública, verificada a 7 de outubro de 2026. As funcionalidades e os preços do Wooclap mudam com frequência — confirme os dados atuais no site deles. Wooclap e outros nomes são marcas dos respetivos titulares; esta página não é aprovada por eles nem está afiliada a eles."}, "it": {"Free plan available": "Piano gratuito disponibile", "Paid one-time and annual plans — see slido.com/pricing": "Piani a pagamento una tantum e annuali: vedi slido.com/pricing", "Annual and enterprise plans": "Piani annuali e aziendali", "Prices in US dollars where shown, checked on 7 October 2026 on each company's own pricing page. They change — please confirm on": "Prezzi in dollari USA dove indicati, verificati il 7 ottobre 2026 sulla pagina prezzi di ciascuna azienda. Cambiano: verificali sulla", "and the other company's before you decide.": "e su quella dell’altra azienda prima di decidere.", "Is PollSlide a good Slido alternative?": "PollSlide è una buona alternativa a Slido?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A in one plan over the slides you already have. Slido is strongest for moderated Q&A in large meetings, especially in Webex. PollSlide adds graded quizzes with game modes, surveys and study sets, and works over Keynote as well as PowerPoint and Google Slides.": "Sì, se vuoi sondaggi, quiz, questionari e domande del pubblico in un solo piano, sopra le slide che hai già. Slido dà il meglio nelle domande moderate di grandi riunioni, soprattutto in Webex. PollSlide aggiunge quiz con punteggio e modalità di gioco, questionari e set di studio, e funziona con Keynote oltre che con PowerPoint e Google Slides.", "Does Slido work inside PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "Slido funziona dentro PowerPoint e Google Slides?", "Yes. Slido offers a PowerPoint add-in and a Google Slides add-on, according to its help community. Its Mac Switcher app, which other presentation tools relied on, was retired in January 2025. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote.": "Sì. Secondo la sua community di assistenza, Slido offre un componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint e uno per Google Slides. La sua app Switcher per Mac, su cui si appoggiavano altri programmi di presentazione, è stata ritirata a gennaio 2025. Il componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint di PollSlide è in revisione da parte di Microsoft; il metodo del QR sulla slide funziona già in PowerPoint, Google Slides e Keynote.", "How do PollSlide and Slido prices compare?": "Come si confrontano i prezzi di PollSlide e Slido?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Slido sells one-time and annual plans; check slido.com/pricing for current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide ha un piano gratuito e Pro a 12 $ al mese (10 $ con fatturazione annuale), con sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio. Slido vende piani una tantum e annuali; vedi slido.com/pricing per i prezzi attuali. Verificato il 7 ottobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Slido and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Confronto basato su informazioni pubbliche, verificate il 7 ottobre 2026. Funzioni e prezzi dei concorrenti cambiano spesso: verificali sul loro sito. Slido e gli altri nomi sono marchi dei rispettivi proprietari; questa pagina non è approvata da loro né affiliata con loro.", "Kahoot! 360 Pro plans from $19/month, billed annually": "Piani Kahoot! 360 Pro da 19 $/mese, fatturazione annuale", "Higher Pro tiers by participant count (up to 2,000+)": "Livelli Pro superiori in base ai partecipanti (fino a oltre 2.000)", "Is PollSlide a good Kahoot alternative?": "PollSlide è una buona alternativa a Kahoot?", "Yes, if you need more than a game-show quiz. PollSlide runs quizzes with game modes alongside real polls, open feedback, surveys and study sets, over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. For a pure high-energy quiz game, especially with younger students, Kahoot is purpose-built.": "Sì, se ti serve più di un quiz in stile gioco a premi. PollSlide unisce quiz con modalità di gioco a veri sondaggi, feedback aperti, questionari e set di studio, sopra la tua presentazione Keynote, PowerPoint o Google Slides. Per un puro quiz pieno di energia, soprattutto con studenti più giovani, Kahoot è fatto apposta.", "Can Kahoot use my existing slides?": "Kahoot può usare le mie slide esistenti?", "Kahoot! 360 can import PowerPoint, Keynote and PDF files, and its Pro Standard plan and above sync with PowerPoint and Google Slides, according to its pricing page. PollSlide works over the original deck itself: paste a QR on any slide, and the Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF.": "Secondo la sua pagina prezzi, Kahoot! 360 può importare file PowerPoint, Keynote e PDF, e dal piano Pro Standard in su si sincronizza con PowerPoint e Google Slides. PollSlide lavora sopra la presentazione originale: incolla un QR su qualsiasi slide e l’app companion per Mac mostra i risultati dal vivo sopra Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF.", "How do PollSlide and Kahoot prices compare?": "Come si confrontano i prezzi di PollSlide e Kahoot?", "PollSlide has a free plan and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually), covering polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets. Kahoot! 360 Pro plans start at $19 a month billed annually, with higher tiers for more participants. Prices checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide ha un piano gratuito e Pro a 12 $ al mese (10 $ con fatturazione annuale), con sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio. I piani Kahoot! 360 Pro partono da 19 $ al mese con fatturazione annuale, con livelli superiori per più partecipanti. Prezzi verificati il 7 ottobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Kahoot and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Confronto basato su informazioni pubbliche, verificate il 7 ottobre 2026. Funzioni e prezzi dei concorrenti cambiano spesso: verificali sul loro sito. Kahoot e gli altri nomi sono marchi dei rispettivi proprietari; questa pagina non è approvata da loro né affiliata con loro.", "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs Poll Everywhere: il confronto onesto", "vs Poll Everywhere": "vs Poll Everywhere", "Poll Everywhere has run live classroom and meeting polls since 2007, with deep Canvas gradebook integration and SMS voting built in. PollSlide takes a different route: one QR you paste onto any slide, in any tool, plus AI that drafts from your own material and a full quiz-and-study suite in one plan.": "Poll Everywhere gestisce sondaggi dal vivo in classe e in riunione dal 2007, con un’integrazione profonda con il registro di Canvas e il voto via SMS. PollSlide segue un’altra strada: un QR da incollare su qualsiasi slide, in qualsiasi strumento, più un’IA che scrive a partire dal tuo materiale e una suite completa di quiz e studio in un solo piano.", "Poll Everywhere is a mature, institutional tool — its Canvas gradebook integration and SMS text-in fallback are genuinely hard to match, especially for large campus lecture classes. PollSlide is built for presenters who don't want to insert activity slides into their deck at all: paste one QR box onto any existing slide, run polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets from a single plan, and let Polly AI draft from a PDF or your own notes instead of just a typed topic.": "Poll Everywhere è uno strumento maturo e istituzionale: l’integrazione con il registro di Canvas e il voto via SMS sono difficili da eguagliare, soprattutto nelle grandi lezioni universitarie. PollSlide è pensato per chi non vuole inserire slide di attività nella presentazione: incolla un riquadro QR su qualsiasi slide esistente, fai sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio con un solo piano e lascia che Polly AI scriva a partire da un PDF o dai tuoi appunti, non solo da un argomento digitato.", "Works the same way on Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF — one method": "Funziona allo stesso modo su Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF: un unico metodo", "Copy a QR box onto any slide in any tool; nothing to rebuild": "Copia un riquadro QR su qualsiasi slide, in qualsiasi strumento; niente da rifare", "Separate native integrations per app; importing a deck into a different tool can break already-embedded activities": "Integrazioni native separate per ogni app; importare una presentazione in un altro strumento può rompere le attività già inserite", "Native add-in already published for your slide app": "Componente aggiuntivo nativo già pubblicato per la tua app di presentazioni", "PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; Google Slides integration is planned, not shipped": "Il componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint è in revisione da parte di Microsoft; l’integrazione con Google Slides è prevista, non ancora disponibile", "Native PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) and Google Slides integrations, plus a Live App overlay for other software": "Integrazioni native con PowerPoint, Keynote (Mac) e Google Slides, più un overlay Live App per altri programmi", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets — one product": "Sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio: un solo prodotto", "Built around live, synchronous activities; no documented async study/review mode": "Pensato per attività dal vivo e sincrone; nessuna modalità di studio o ripasso asincrona documentata", "AI drafts questions from your own PDF or notes": "L’IA scrive domande a partire dal tuo PDF o dai tuoi appunti", "Polly AI works from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or pasted notes": "Polly AI lavora a partire da un argomento, un PDF caricato o appunti incollati", "Generates multiple-choice questions from a typed topic; no documented ability to read an uploaded deck or PDF": "Genera domande a scelta multipla da un argomento digitato; nessuna capacità documentata di leggere una presentazione o un PDF caricato", "AI turns open-text answers into themes + sentiment": "L’IA trasforma le risposte aperte in temi + sentiment", "SMS text-in voting (no app, no data plan needed)": "Voto via SMS (senza app né traffico dati)", "A real advantage for audiences with limited phone data or no ability to install anything": "Un vero vantaggio per un pubblico con pochi dati o senza possibilità di installare nulla", "Native LMS gradebook integration (e.g. Canvas)": "Integrazione nativa con il registro dell’LMS (es. Canvas)", "Deep higher-ed install base, with roster import for attendance": "Forte diffusione nell’istruzione superiore, con importazione degli elenchi per le presenze", "Free companion app floats results over your presentation automatically": "L’app companion gratuita mostra automaticamente i risultati sopra la presentazione", "macOS only today; the QR-on-slide method itself needs zero install on any OS": "Per ora solo macOS; il metodo del QR sulla slide non richiede installazioni su nessun sistema", "A Live App overlay covers other software; the deepest experience is inside their own native add-ins": "Un overlay Live App copre altri programmi; l’esperienza più completa è nei loro componenti aggiuntivi nativi", "Free tier for real sessions": "Piano gratuito per sessioni reali", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, 5 Polly generations/month — no card required": "3 presentazioni salvate, 25 partecipanti per sessione, 5 generazioni Polly al mese, senza carta", "Free \"Intro\" plan: up to 40 people (700 for the first 30 days), per its plans page": "Piano gratuito «Intro»: fino a 40 persone (700 nei primi 30 giorni), secondo la sua pagina dei piani", "Team quiz scoring rewards accuracy, not just table size": "Il punteggio a squadre premia la precisione, non solo la dimensione del gruppo", "Score averages per player, so a bigger team doesn't automatically win": "Il punteggio è la media per giocatore, quindi una squadra più numerosa non vince automaticamente", "Scoring mechanics for their team competitions aren't publicly documented": "Le regole di punteggio delle loro gare a squadre non sono documentate pubblicamente", "One method, every deck": "Un metodo, ogni presentazione", "Paste a QR box onto any slide in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF and present as normal — no add-in to install, and nothing to rebuild if you switch tools later.": "Incolla un riquadro QR su qualsiasi slide in Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF e presenta come sempre: nessun componente da installare e niente da rifare se più avanti cambi strumento.", "AI that reads your material": "Un’IA che legge il tuo materiale", "Polly drafts questions from a topic, an uploaded PDF, or your own notes — and turns open-text answers into themes and sentiment as they come in.": "Polly scrive domande da un argomento, un PDF caricato o i tuoi appunti, e trasforma le risposte aperte in temi e sentiment man mano che arrivano.", "One suite, one plan": "Una suite, un piano", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions.": "Sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio in un solo piano, con un piano gratuito che permette sessioni reali.", "Free — up to 40 people per poll": "Gratis: fino a 40 persone per sondaggio", "Present — $10/month, or $120 billed annually": "Present: 10 $/mese, o 120 $ con fatturazione annuale", "Engage and Teams plans, priced per organisation": "Piani Engage e Teams, con prezzo per organizzazione", "🤝 When Poll Everywhere might be the better fit": "🤝 Quando Poll Everywhere può essere più adatto", "Poll Everywhere has been refining live classroom and meeting polling since 2007, and it shows: campuses standardized on Canvas get native gradebook and roster integration that PollSlide doesn't offer, and SMS text-in voting is a genuine fallback for audiences without reliable phone data or the ability to install anything. If that institutional depth — or a text-in option — is what you need, Poll Everywhere is worth a look. PollSlide is the better fit when you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study in one plan, AI that works from your own material, and nothing to rebuild when you switch presentation tools.": "Poll Everywhere perfeziona i sondaggi dal vivo per lezioni e riunioni dal 2007, e si vede: i campus che usano Canvas hanno un’integrazione nativa con registro ed elenchi che PollSlide non offre, e il voto via SMS è una vera alternativa per un pubblico senza dati affidabili o che non può installare nulla. Se ti serve questa profondità istituzionale, o il voto via SMS, Poll Everywhere merita uno sguardo. PollSlide è più adatto quando vuoi sondaggi, quiz, questionari e studio in un solo piano, un’IA che lavora con il tuo materiale e niente da rifare quando cambi strumento di presentazione.", "Is PollSlide a good Poll Everywhere alternative?": "PollSlide è una buona alternativa a Poll Everywhere?", "Yes, if you want polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in one plan, plus AI that turns open answers into themes. Poll Everywhere is a long-established choice with SMS text-in voting and deep LMS integration, which PollSlide does not offer.": "Sì, se vuoi sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio in un solo piano, più un’IA che trasforma le risposte aperte in temi. Poll Everywhere è una scelta consolidata, con voto via SMS e integrazione LMS approfondita, che PollSlide non offre.", "Does Poll Everywhere work inside PowerPoint and Keynote?": "Poll Everywhere funziona dentro PowerPoint e Keynote?", "Yes. Poll Everywhere lists PowerPoint integration on all its plans and offers a presenter add-in for PowerPoint and Keynote on Mac. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF with a QR on the slide; its PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft.": "Sì. Poll Everywhere include l’integrazione con PowerPoint in tutti i piani e offre un componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint e Keynote su Mac. PollSlide funziona sopra Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF con un QR sulla slide; il suo componente per PowerPoint è in revisione da parte di Microsoft.", "How do PollSlide and Poll Everywhere prices compare?": "Come si confrontano i prezzi di PollSlide e Poll Everywhere?", "PollSlide has a free plan for 25 participants per session and Pro at $12 a month ($10 billed annually). Poll Everywhere's free plan allows up to 40 people, and its Present plan is $10 a month or $120 billed annually, priced per organisation. Checked 7 October 2026.": "PollSlide ha un piano gratuito per 25 partecipanti per sessione e Pro a 12 $ al mese (10 $ con fatturazione annuale). Il piano gratuito di Poll Everywhere consente fino a 40 persone e il piano Present costa 10 $ al mese o 120 $ con fatturazione annuale, con prezzo per organizzazione. Verificato il 7 ottobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. Poll Everywhere and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Confronto basato su informazioni pubbliche, verificate il 7 ottobre 2026. Funzioni e prezzi dei concorrenti cambiano spesso: verificali sul loro sito. Poll Everywhere e gli altri nomi sono marchi dei rispettivi proprietari; questa pagina non è approvata da loro né affiliata con loro.", "PollSlide vs AhaSlides — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs AhaSlides: il confronto onesto", "vs AhaSlides": "vs AhaSlides", "AhaSlides packs polls, quizzes, word clouds, brainstorm boards and more into its own online editor, with real AI question generation built in. PollSlide takes a different bet: your own Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or PDF stays exactly as you built it, with a QR on the slide as the one method that works on every surface — Keynote included.": "AhaSlides riunisce sondaggi, quiz, nuvole di parole, bacheche di idee e altro nel proprio editor online, con una vera generazione di domande tramite IA. PollSlide punta su altro: il tuo Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o PDF resta esattamente com’è, con un QR sulla slide come unico metodo che funziona ovunque, Keynote compreso.", "AhaSlides is a genuinely broad, easy-to-use interaction platform — if you're happy building or importing your content into its own editor. PollSlide is built around the opposite bet: you keep presenting your original deck, unchanged, from any app including Keynote, while Polly AI drafts the questions and a QR on the slide is the one method that works everywhere without an install.": "AhaSlides è una piattaforma di interazione davvero ampia e semplice, se ti va bene creare o importare i contenuti nel suo editor. PollSlide scommette sul contrario: continui a presentare la tua presentazione originale, senza modifiche, da qualsiasi app, Keynote compreso, mentre Polly AI scrive le domande e un QR sulla slide è l’unico metodo che funziona ovunque senza installare nulla.", "Presents from your existing Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF, unmodified": "Presenta dal tuo Keynote / PowerPoint / Google Slides / PDF esistente, senza modifiche", "Imports convert slides to static images inside AhaSlides' own editor": "Le importazioni convertono le slide in immagini statiche nell’editor di AhaSlides", "Works with Keynote at all": "Funziona con Keynote", "QR-on-slide works everywhere; free Mac companion floats results on top": "Il QR sulla slide funziona ovunque; l’app companion gratuita per Mac mostra i risultati sopra", "No Keynote add-in — an open, undated request on AhaSlides' own forum": "Nessun componente per Keynote: una richiesta aperta e senza data sul forum di AhaSlides", "Library of interaction types (word clouds, brainstorm boards, spinner wheel, rating scales)": "Libreria di tipi di interazione (nuvole di parole, bacheche di idee, ruota, scale di valutazione)", "From a topic, notes, or a PDF": "Da un argomento, appunti o un PDF", "From an uploaded PDF, PPT, Word or Excel file": "Da un file PDF, PPT, Word o Excel caricato", "Free tier that runs a full, real session": "Piano gratuito che permette una vera sessione completa", "25 participants, 5 Polly AI generations/month, no card": "25 partecipanti, 5 generazioni Polly AI al mese, senza carta", "50 participants, but capped at 5 quiz + 3 poll questions per presentation": "50 partecipanti, ma con un massimo di 5 domande quiz + 3 di sondaggio per presentazione", "Imports keep your animations, embedded audio/video and links": "Le importazioni mantengono animazioni, audio/video incorporati e link", "Nothing to import — you present the original file": "Niente da importare: presenti il file originale", "Import strips animations, audio/video and links (50MB / 100-slide limit)": "L’importazione elimina animazioni, audio/video e link (limite di 50 MB / 100 slide)", "Tiered per-plan pricing; verify current terms on their site": "Prezzi a livelli in base al piano; verifica le condizioni attuali sul loro sito", "Keep your slides, exactly as built": "Tieni le tue slide esattamente come le hai create", "PollSlide floats a QR over the deck you already made — Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, a PDF. Nothing gets rebuilt or converted into static images inside someone else's editor.": "PollSlide mette un QR sopra la presentazione che hai già fatto: Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides, un PDF. Niente viene rifatto o convertito in immagini statiche nell’editor di qualcun altro.", "Actually works on Keynote": "Funziona davvero con Keynote", "Keynote has no public plugin ecosystem, so the QR-on-slide method plus a free Mac companion app is the real, shipped answer — not an open feature request.": "Keynote non ha un ecosistema pubblico di plugin, quindi il metodo del QR sulla slide e un’app companion gratuita per Mac sono la risposta reale e già disponibile, non una richiesta in sospeso.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study sets in a single plan, with a free tier that runs real sessions — not a handful of questions to test the water.": "Sondaggi, questionari, quiz e set di studio in un solo piano, con un piano gratuito che permette sessioni reali, non una manciata di domande per provare.", "Free — 50 participants, a few quiz and poll questions per presentation": "Gratis: 50 partecipanti, poche domande di quiz e sondaggio per presentazione", "Paid plans billed monthly or yearly — see ahaslides.com/pricing": "Piani a pagamento mensili o annuali: vedi ahaslides.com/pricing", "Team plans with volume discounts": "Piani team con sconti per volume", "🤝 When AhaSlides might be the better fit": "🤝 Quando AhaSlides può essere più adatto", "If you want the widest single toolbox of interaction types — word clouds, brainstorm boards, a spinner wheel, rating scales — built and templated inside one polished editor, AhaSlides already ships all of that, and its AI question generator and PowerPoint add-in are live today, not in review. PollSlide is the better fit when presenting your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — matters more to you than that breadth of interaction types.": "Se vuoi la cassetta degli attrezzi più ampia di tipi di interazione (nuvole di parole, bacheche di idee, ruota, scale di valutazione) in un editor curato e con modelli, AhaSlides offre già tutto questo, e il suo generatore di domande con IA e il componente per PowerPoint sono già disponibili, non in revisione. PollSlide è più adatto quando presentare la tua presentazione esattamente come l’hai creata, Keynote compreso, ti importa più di quella varietà di interazioni.", "Is PollSlide a good AhaSlides alternative?": "PollSlide è una buona alternativa ad AhaSlides?", "Yes, if you want to present your own deck exactly as you built it — Keynote included — with live polls, quizzes, surveys and Q&A on top. AhaSlides has a wider toolbox of interaction types inside its own editor, and a PowerPoint add-in available today.": "Sì, se vuoi presentare la tua presentazione esattamente come l’hai creata, Keynote compreso, con sondaggi dal vivo, quiz, questionari e domande del pubblico sopra. AhaSlides ha più tipi di interazione nel proprio editor e un componente per PowerPoint già disponibile.", "Does AhaSlides work with PowerPoint and Google Slides?": "AhaSlides funziona con PowerPoint e Google Slides?", "Yes. According to its pricing page you can import PowerPoint slides into AhaSlides or add AhaSlides to a PowerPoint presentation with its add-in, and it integrates with Google Slides. Keynote is not mentioned. PollSlide works over Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides or a PDF.": "Sì. Secondo la sua pagina prezzi, puoi importare slide di PowerPoint in AhaSlides o aggiungere AhaSlides a una presentazione PowerPoint con il suo componente, e si integra con Google Slides. Keynote non è menzionato. PollSlide funziona sopra Keynote, PowerPoint, Google Slides o un PDF.", "How do PollSlide and AhaSlides prices compare?": "Come si confrontano i prezzi di PollSlide e AhaSlides?", "Both have a free plan: PollSlide's runs real sessions for 25 participants, AhaSlides' allows 50 participants with a few quiz and poll questions per presentation. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); check ahaslides.com/pricing for its current prices. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Entrambi hanno un piano gratuito: quello di PollSlide permette sessioni reali con 25 partecipanti, quello di AhaSlides 50 partecipanti con poche domande di quiz e sondaggio per presentazione. PollSlide Pro costa 12 $ al mese (10 $ con fatturazione annuale); vedi ahaslides.com/pricing per i prezzi attuali. Verificato il 7 ottobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Competitor features and pricing change often — please verify on their site. AhaSlides and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Confronto basato su informazioni pubbliche, verificate il 7 ottobre 2026. Funzioni e prezzi dei concorrenti cambiano spesso: verificali sul loro sito. AhaSlides e gli altri nomi sono marchi dei rispettivi proprietari; questa pagina non è approvata da loro né affiliata con loro.", "PollSlide vs Wooclap — the honest comparison": "PollSlide vs Wooclap: il confronto onesto", "vs Wooclap": "vs Wooclap", "Wooclap packs in 20+ question types and deep LMS/SSO integrations — but it asks you to build your session in its own editor, or let its add-in insert its own slides into PowerPoint or Google Slides. PollSlide asks for none of that: paste a QR box on the slide you already made, in any app, and results appear on top.": "Wooclap offre più di 20 tipi di domande e integrazioni LMS/SSO approfondite, ma ti chiede di creare la sessione nel suo editor o di lasciare che il suo componente inserisca le proprie slide in PowerPoint o Google Slides. PollSlide non ti chiede niente di tutto questo: incolla un riquadro QR sulla slide che hai già fatto, in qualsiasi app, e i risultati compaiono sopra.", "Wooclap is a mature, feature-rich platform for building a session inside its own event editor — or inserting its interactive slides into PowerPoint (native add-in) or Google Slides (browser extension) — with a big question-type library and real LMS/SSO wiring for schools and enterprise. PollSlide takes the opposite approach: your existing Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides or PDF deck never gets touched or converted — a QR box you paste onto any slide is the whole integration, and one free Mac companion floats results over whatever app you're already presenting from.": "Wooclap è una piattaforma matura e ricca di funzioni per creare una sessione nel proprio editor di eventi, o inserire le sue slide interattive in PowerPoint (componente nativo) o Google Slides (estensione del browser), con un’ampia libreria di tipi di domande e un vero collegamento LMS/SSO per scuole e aziende. PollSlide fa il contrario: la tua presentazione Keynote, PowerPoint, Slides o PDF non viene mai toccata né convertita; un riquadro QR incollato su qualsiasi slide è tutta l’integrazione, e un’app companion gratuita per Mac mostra i risultati sopra l’app da cui stai già presentando.", "Your original deck stays completely untouched": "La tua presentazione originale resta del tutto intatta", "No import, no conversion, no inserted slides": "Niente importazione, niente conversione, niente slide inserite", "PowerPoint/Slides work by inserting Wooclap's own slides into your deck": "In PowerPoint/Slides funziona inserendo le slide di Wooclap nella tua presentazione", "Keynote keeps its native animations, video & links": "Keynote mantiene animazioni, video e link nativi", "Your Keynote file is never converted": "Il tuo file Keynote non viene mai convertito", "Wooclap's own docs group Keynote with PDF uploads — converted to static images, losing animations, hyperlinks and video": "La documentazione di Wooclap raggruppa Keynote con i caricamenti PDF: convertito in immagini statiche, perdendo animazioni, link e video", "Background companion overlays results on any app": "Un’app companion in background mostra i risultati sopra qualsiasi app", "Free Mac menu-bar app floats results over Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF automatically": "Un’app gratuita nella barra dei menu del Mac mostra automaticamente i risultati sopra Keynote/PowerPoint/PDF", "Live results only appear inside Wooclap's web player, PowerPoint pane, or its own inserted slides": "I risultati dal vivo compaiono solo nel player web di Wooclap, nel suo pannello di PowerPoint o nelle sue slide inserite", "Native PowerPoint add-in": "Componente aggiuntivo nativo per PowerPoint", "A native Office add-in is in review with Microsoft, not yet published": "Un componente aggiuntivo nativo per Office è in revisione da parte di Microsoft, non ancora pubblicato", "Established add-in, in use today": "Componente consolidato, in uso oggi", "LMS sync & SSO/SAML for institutions": "Sincronizzazione LMS e SSO/SAML per gli istituti", "Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard sync, SSO/SAML/CAS on enterprise tiers": "Sincronizzazione con Moodle/Canvas/Blackboard, SSO/SAML/CAS nei livelli enterprise", "No install or account needed for your audience": "Il tuo pubblico non deve installare nulla né creare un account", "AI drafts questions from your content": "L’IA scrive domande a partire dai tuoi contenuti", "From a topic, a PDF, or your own notes — plus matching images": "Da un argomento, un PDF o i tuoi appunti, con immagini abbinate", "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard generates from an uploaded document, PDF, audio/video or URL": "Wooclap AI / Quiz Wizard genera da un documento, PDF, audio/video o URL caricato", "Polls, surveys, quizzes and study — one flat plan": "Sondaggi, questionari, quiz e studio: un unico piano", "One platform, but export, unlimited questions, AI and branding are split across Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate tiers": "Una piattaforma, ma esportazione, domande illimitate, IA e branding sono suddivisi tra i livelli Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate", "Free tier with no rolling question cap": "Piano gratuito senza limite periodico di domande", "3 saved presentations, 25 participants/session, no credit card": "3 presentazioni salvate, 25 partecipanti per sessione, senza carta di credito", "Free Starter caps active questions at 5 per rolling 30-day period, and doesn't allow exporting results": "Il piano gratuito Starter limita le domande attive a 5 ogni 30 giorni e non permette di esportare i risultati", "Breadth of built-in question-type formats": "Varietà di formati di domanda integrati", "Covers the core interactive types": "Copre i tipi interattivi principali", "20+ formats — word cloud, ranking, matching, brainstorming, spin-the-wheel and more": "Oltre 20 formati: nuvola di parole, classifica, abbinamento, brainstorming, ruota e altro", "Your deck stays exactly as you built it": "La tua presentazione resta esattamente come l’hai creata", "No exporting into Wooclap's editor, no letting an add-in insert someone else's slides, no Keynote file getting flattened into static images. Paste a QR box on the slide you already made and present like you always do.": "Niente esportazione nell’editor di Wooclap, nessun componente che inserisce slide altrui, nessun file Keynote ridotto a immagini statiche. Incolla un riquadro QR sulla slide che hai già fatto e presenta come sempre.", "One companion, not an add-in per app": "Un’unica app companion, non un componente per ogni app", "The free Mac companion floats live results over Keynote, PowerPoint or a PDF automatically — no add-in pane to manage, no browser extension, no separate web player to babysit.": "L’app companion gratuita per Mac mostra automaticamente i risultati dal vivo sopra Keynote, PowerPoint o un PDF: nessun pannello da gestire, nessuna estensione del browser, nessun player web separato da sorvegliare.", "Polls, surveys, quizzes, study — one price": "Sondaggi, questionari, quiz, studio: un solo prezzo", "Everything runs on a single flat plan with a free tier that runs real sessions, not a Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate ladder where exporting and AI sit behind higher tiers.": "Tutto funziona con un unico piano e un piano gratuito che permette sessioni reali, non una scala Starter/Basic/Pro/Corporate dove esportazione e IA stanno nei livelli superiori.", "Free Starter plan — 5 questions a month": "Piano gratuito Starter: 5 domande al mese", "Basic and Pro plans, billed annually — see wooclap.com/pricing": "Piani Basic e Pro con fatturazione annuale: vedi wooclap.com/pricing", "Corporate from 6 presenters": "Corporate da 6 relatori", "Campus and corporate — custom": "Campus e aziende: su misura", "🤝 When Wooclap might be the better fit": "🤝 Quando Wooclap può essere più adatto", "Wooclap's library of 20+ interactive question types — word clouds, ranking, matching, brainstorming boards, spin-the-wheel and more — goes well beyond a typical live-polling tool, and its LMS sync (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) plus SSO/SAML/CAS make it a genuinely strong fit for IT-managed school or enterprise rollouts. If that specific breadth or institutional wiring is what you need, Wooclap is worth a look.": "La libreria di oltre 20 tipi di domande interattive di Wooclap (nuvole di parole, classifiche, abbinamenti, bacheche di idee, ruota e altro) va ben oltre un normale strumento di sondaggi, e la sincronizzazione LMS (Moodle, Canvas, Blackboard) con SSO/SAML/CAS lo rende molto adatto a implementazioni gestite dall’IT in scuole o aziende. Se ti serve proprio questa varietà o questo collegamento istituzionale, Wooclap merita uno sguardo.", "Is PollSlide a good Wooclap alternative?": "PollSlide è una buona alternativa a Wooclap?", "Yes, if you want polls, quizzes, surveys and study sets in one flat plan over your own Keynote, PowerPoint or Google Slides deck. Wooclap has a broad library of question types and LMS sync with SSO, which suits IT-managed school and enterprise rollouts.": "Sì, se vuoi sondaggi, quiz, questionari e set di studio in un unico piano sopra la tua presentazione Keynote, PowerPoint o Google Slides. Wooclap ha un’ampia libreria di tipi di domande e la sincronizzazione LMS con SSO, adatta a implementazioni gestite dall’IT in scuole e aziende.", "Does Wooclap work inside PowerPoint?": "Wooclap funziona dentro PowerPoint?", "Yes. Wooclap says it works with PowerPoint, Google Slides and Microsoft Teams. PollSlide's PowerPoint add-in is in review with Microsoft; the QR-on-slide method works today in PowerPoint, Google Slides and Keynote, and the Mac companion floats live results over any deck.": "Sì. Wooclap dichiara di funzionare con PowerPoint, Google Slides e Microsoft Teams. Il componente aggiuntivo per PowerPoint di PollSlide è in revisione da parte di Microsoft; il metodo del QR sulla slide funziona già in PowerPoint, Google Slides e Keynote, e l’app companion per Mac mostra i risultati dal vivo sopra qualsiasi presentazione.", "How do PollSlide and Wooclap prices compare?": "Come si confrontano i prezzi di PollSlide e Wooclap?", "Both have a free plan. Wooclap's Starter plan allows 5 questions a month; PollSlide's free plan runs full sessions for 25 participants. PollSlide Pro is $12 a month ($10 billed annually); Wooclap's paid plans are billed annually — check wooclap.com/pricing. Checked 7 October 2026.": "Entrambi hanno un piano gratuito. Il piano Starter di Wooclap consente 5 domande al mese; il piano gratuito di PollSlide permette sessioni complete con 25 partecipanti. PollSlide Pro costa 12 $ al mese (10 $ con fatturazione annuale); i piani a pagamento di Wooclap si pagano annualmente: vedi wooclap.com/pricing. Verificato il 7 ottobre 2026.", "Comparison based on publicly available information, checked 7 October 2026. Wooclap's features and pricing change often — please verify current details on their site. Wooclap and other names are trademarks of their respective owners; this page is not endorsed by or affiliated with them.": "Confronto basato su informazioni pubbliche, verificate il 7 ottobre 2026. Funzioni e prezzi di Wooclap cambiano spesso: verifica i dati attuali sul loro sito. Wooclap e gli altri nomi sono marchi dei rispettivi proprietari; questa pagina non è approvata da loro né affiliata con loro."}});
